window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":1,"en":"AI Trends & Their Effects on Education and Society","zh":"人工智慧趨勢及其對教育與社會的影響","items":[{"w":"automate","pos":"v.","def":"to make a machine or computer do a job without people","cn":"使自動化","s":"Many banks now ________ simple customer questions with smart software, so staff can spend more time on difficult problems.","zh":"許多銀行現在用智慧軟體將簡單的顧客問題自動化,因此員工能花更多時間處理困難的問題。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A1","t":"自動化"},{"w":"automation","pos":"n.","def":"the use of machines and computers to do work","cn":"自動化","s":"Thanks to ________ in the factory, the cars are built much faster, but some workers worry about losing their jobs.","zh":"多虧了工廠裡的自動化,汽車的製造速度快了許多,但有些工人擔心會失去工作。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A2","t":"自動化"},{"w":"robotics","pos":"n.","def":"the science of designing and building robots","cn":"機器人學","s":"My cousin joined the school ________ club last year, and now he can build a small robot that follows a black line.","zh":"我表弟去年加入了學校的機器人社團,現在他能做出一台會沿著黑線前進的小機器人。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A3","t":"機器人"},{"w":"bug","pos":"n.","def":"a mistake in a computer program","cn":"程式錯誤","s":"The new game kept crashing because of a small ________ in the code, so the company quickly released an update.","zh":"這款新遊戲因為程式碼中的一個小程式錯誤而一直當機,所以公司很快就發布了更新。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A4","t":"程式錯誤"},{"w":"software","pos":"n.","def":"programs that tell a computer what to do","cn":"軟體","s":"Our school bought new learning ________ for every classroom, but the teachers needed a week of training before using it.","zh":"我們學校為每間教室購買了新的學習軟體,但老師們在使用前需要一週的培訓。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A5","t":"軟體"},{"w":"hardware","pos":"n.","def":"the physical parts of a computer, like the screen and keyboard","cn":"硬體","s":"The ________ in the computer lab is very old, so the new AI programs run slowly and often freeze.","zh":"電腦教室裡的硬體非常老舊,所以新的人工智慧程式跑得很慢,而且常常當機。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A6","t":"硬體"},{"w":"programmer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who writes computer programs","cn":"程式設計師","s":"My uncle works as a ________ at a tech company, and he spends most of his day writing and testing code.","zh":"我叔叔在一家科技公司擔任程式設計師,他一天大部分的時間都在寫程式和測試程式碼。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A7","t":"程式設計師"},{"w":"coding","pos":"n.","def":"writing instructions for a computer","cn":"寫程式;編碼","s":"Some primary schools now teach ________ to young children because they believe it helps them think step by step.","zh":"有些小學現在教小孩子寫程式,因為他們認為這能幫助孩子一步一步地思考。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A8","t":"寫程式"},{"w":"dataset","pos":"n.","def":"a large collection of information used by a computer","cn":"資料集","s":"The company trained its AI on a huge ________ of photos, but the system still made mistakes with darker images.","zh":"這家公司用一個龐大的照片資料集訓練它的人工智慧,但系統在較暗的圖片上仍然會出錯。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A9","t":"資料集"},{"w":"database","pos":"n.","def":"an organised collection of information stored on a computer","cn":"資料庫","s":"The library keeps all its book records in an online ________, so students can check if a book is available from home.","zh":"圖書館把所有的書籍紀錄存放在線上資料庫裡,所以學生在家就能查詢某本書是否可借。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A10","t":"資料庫"},{"w":"computing","pos":"n.","def":"the use or study of computers","cn":"電腦運算;計算","s":"Modern AI needs a great deal of ________ power, so tech companies are building huge data centres around the world.","zh":"現代人工智慧需要大量的運算能力,所以科技公司正在世界各地興建巨大的資料中心。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A11","t":"運算"},{"w":"processor","pos":"n.","def":"the main part of a computer that does calculations","cn":"處理器","s":"My old laptop has a slow ________, so it takes almost a minute to open a video editing program.","zh":"我的舊筆電有一顆很慢的處理器,所以打開影片剪輯程式幾乎要花一分鐘。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A12","t":"處理器"},{"w":"chip","pos":"n.","def":"a very small piece of material inside electronic devices","cn":"晶片","s":"Taiwan makes many of the world's most advanced computer ________s, and these are used in phones and AI servers.","zh":"台灣製造許多世界上最先進的電腦晶片,而這些晶片被用在手機和人工智慧伺服器中。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A13","t":"晶片"},{"w":"server","pos":"n.","def":"a powerful computer that stores data and runs services for others","cn":"伺服器","s":"The online exam stopped for twenty minutes because the ________ crashed, so the teacher gave everyone extra time.","zh":"線上考試停擺了二十分鐘,因為伺服器當機了,所以老師給大家延長了時間。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A14","t":"伺服器"},{"w":"cloud","pos":"n.","def":"online storage and services on distant computers","cn":"雲端","s":"I save all my school projects in the ________, so I can open them on my phone even if my laptop breaks.","zh":"我把所有學校作業都存在雲端,所以即使筆電壞了,我也能用手機打開它們。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A15","t":"雲端"},{"w":"upgrade","pos":"v.","def":"to make a machine or program newer and better","cn":"升級","s":"We decided to ________ our home computer last month, because the old one could not run the new translation app.","zh":"我們上個月決定把家裡的電腦升級,因為舊電腦跑不動新的翻譯應用程式。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A16","t":"升級"},{"w":"install","pos":"v.","def":"to put a program onto a computer or phone","cn":"安裝","s":"Before the class started, the teacher asked us to ________ the learning app, but my phone did not have enough space.","zh":"上課開始前,老師要我們安裝學習應用程式,但我的手機空間不夠。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A17","t":"安裝"},{"w":"interface","pos":"n.","def":"the part of a program that a user sees and uses","cn":"介面","s":"The new app has a simple ________ with large buttons, so even my grandparents can use it without help.","zh":"這個新應用程式有一個簡單的介面,按鈕很大,所以連我的祖父母都能自己使用。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A18","t":"介面"},{"w":"sensor","pos":"n.","def":"a device that notices light, heat, movement or sound","cn":"感測器","s":"The smart light in our hallway has a ________ that notices movement, so it turns on when someone walks past at night.","zh":"我們走廊的智慧燈有一個能偵測動作的感測器,所以晚上有人經過時燈就會亮起。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A19","t":"感測器"},{"w":"virtual","pos":"adj.","def":"existing on a computer, not in the real world","cn":"虛擬的","s":"Our class took a ________ tour of a museum in Paris, and we could look around every room without leaving Taipei.","zh":"我們班參加了巴黎一間博物館的虛擬導覽,我們不用離開台北就能逛遍每個展間。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A20","t":"虛擬"},{"w":"digital","pos":"adj.","def":"using computer technology","cn":"數位的","s":"More and more students read ________ textbooks on tablets, but some say paper books are easier on their eyes.","zh":"越來越多學生在平板上閱讀數位課本,但有些人說紙本書對眼睛比較好。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A21","t":"數位"},{"w":"digitise","pos":"v.","def":"to change paper documents or pictures into computer files","cn":"數位化","s":"The city library plans to ________ its old newspapers, so researchers can search them online instead of visiting in person.","zh":"市立圖書館計畫將舊報紙數位化,這樣研究人員就能上網搜尋,而不必親自到館。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A22","t":"數位化"},{"w":"artificial","pos":"adj.","def":"made by people, not natural","cn":"人造的;人工的","s":"The robot dog looks friendly, but its ________ fur feels strange when you touch it, so my little sister was scared.","zh":"這隻機器狗看起來很友善,但牠的人造毛摸起來很奇怪,所以我妹妹嚇到了。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A23","t":"人造"},{"w":"robotic","pos":"adj.","def":"related to or like a robot","cn":"機器人的;機械般的","s":"The hospital uses a ________ arm during some operations, because it can make very small and steady movements.","zh":"這家醫院在某些手術中使用機器手臂,因為它能做出非常細微又穩定的動作。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A24","t":"機器"},{"w":"simulate","pos":"v.","def":"to copy how something happens in real life using a computer","cn":"模擬","s":"Pilots practise in machines that ________ bad weather, so they know what to do before they face a real storm.","zh":"飛行員在能模擬惡劣天氣的機器裡練習,這樣他們在遇到真正的暴風雨之前就知道該怎麼做。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A25","t":"模擬"},{"w":"simulation","pos":"n.","def":"a computer copy of a real situation used for practice or study","cn":"模擬","s":"The science teacher showed us a ________ of an earthquake, and we could see how different buildings shake and fall.","zh":"自然老師給我們看了一段地震的模擬,我們可以看到不同的建築物如何搖晃和倒塌。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A26","t":"模擬"},{"w":"bandwidth","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of data an internet connection can carry","cn":"頻寬","s":"Our home internet does not have enough ________, so the video keeps stopping when my brother and I are online together.","zh":"我們家的網路頻寬不夠,所以當我和哥哥同時上網時,影片一直卡住。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A27","t":"頻寬"},{"w":"glitch","pos":"n.","def":"a small problem that stops something working properly","cn":"小故障","s":"A ________ in the school's website showed the wrong exam dates, but the office fixed it before anyone got confused.","zh":"學校網站上的一個小故障顯示了錯誤的考試日期,但辦公室在任何人搞混之前就修好了。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A28","t":"小故障"},{"w":"malfunction","pos":"v.","def":"to fail to work in the correct way","cn":"故障;運作失常","s":"The self-checkout machine began to ________ during the busy lunch hour, so a staff member had to help every customer.","zh":"自助結帳機在忙碌的午餐時間開始故障,所以一位店員必須幫每位顧客結帳。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A29","t":"故障"},{"w":"prototype","pos":"n.","def":"the first model of a new product, made for testing","cn":"原型;樣品","s":"The students built a ________ of a smart trash can, and although it was rough, the judges liked their idea.","zh":"學生們做了一個智慧垃圾桶的原型,雖然還很粗糙,但評審很喜歡他們的點子。","part":"A","sec":"AI & Technology Basics 人工智慧與科技基礎","lab":"A30","t":"原型"},{"w":"privacy","pos":"n.","def":"the right to keep your personal life secret","cn":"隱私","s":"Many parents worry about their children's ________, because some apps collect photos and locations without asking clearly.","zh":"許多家長擔心孩子的隱私,因為有些應用程式在沒有清楚詢問的情況下收集照片和位置。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A31","t":"隱私"},{"w":"surveillance","pos":"n.","def":"the careful watching of people, often by cameras","cn":"監視","s":"The city added more ________ cameras near the station, and although crime dropped, some people felt they were always being watched.","zh":"市政府在車站附近增設了更多監視攝影機,雖然犯罪減少了,但有些人覺得自己一直被盯著。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A32","t":"監視"},{"w":"hacker","pos":"n.","def":"a person who breaks into computer systems","cn":"駭客","s":"A ________ broke into the shop's website last week, so the owner told all customers to change their passwords.","zh":"上週一名駭客入侵了這家店的網站,所以店主告訴所有顧客要更改密碼。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A33","t":"駭客"},{"w":"hack","pos":"v.","def":"to secretly get into someone's computer or account","cn":"入侵(電腦);駭入","s":"Someone tried to ________ my email account, but the system sent me a warning, so I changed my password at once.","zh":"有人試圖駭入我的電子郵件帳號,但系統傳了警告給我,所以我立刻更改了密碼。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A34","t":"駭入"},{"w":"cyberattack","pos":"n.","def":"an attack on computer systems through the internet","cn":"網路攻擊","s":"The hospital's computers stopped working after a ________, so doctors had to write patient notes by hand for two days.","zh":"醫院的電腦在一次網路攻擊後停止運作,所以醫生們有兩天必須手寫病人的紀錄。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A35","t":"網路攻擊"},{"w":"encryption","pos":"n.","def":"changing data into a secret code so others cannot read it","cn":"加密","s":"This messaging app uses strong ________, so even the company itself cannot read the messages that users send.","zh":"這個通訊應用程式使用強大的加密技術,所以連公司本身都無法讀取使用者傳送的訊息。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A36","t":"加密"},{"w":"encrypt","pos":"v.","def":"to put information into a secret code","cn":"將…加密","s":"You should ________ important files before you send them online, because anyone could read them if they are stolen.","zh":"你在網路上傳送重要檔案之前應該先將它們加密,因為萬一被偷,任何人都能讀取。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A37","t":"加密"},{"w":"password","pos":"n.","def":"a secret word or set of letters used to enter an account","cn":"密碼","s":"My brother uses the same ________ for every website, but I told him that this makes it easy for hackers.","zh":"我哥哥在每個網站都用同一組密碼,但我告訴他這樣會讓駭客很容易得手。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A38","t":"密碼"},{"w":"breach","pos":"n.","def":"an event where private information is stolen or shown","cn":"外洩;違反","s":"After a data ________ at the online store, thousands of customers' phone numbers appeared on the internet, so many people were angry.","zh":"那家網路商店發生資料外洩後,數千名顧客的電話號碼出現在網路上,因此許多人非常生氣。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A39","t":"外洩"},{"w":"leak","pos":"v.","def":"to let secret information become known","cn":"洩漏","s":"An employee ________ed the details of the new phone before its launch, and the company lost its big surprise.","zh":"一名員工在新手機發表前洩漏了它的細節,公司因此失去了大驚喜。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A40","t":"洩漏"},{"w":"consent","pos":"n.","def":"permission to do something","cn":"同意;許可","s":"The school must get parents' ________ before it posts students' photos online, because some families want to protect their privacy.","zh":"學校在網路上張貼學生照片之前必須取得家長的同意,因為有些家庭想保護他們的隱私。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A41","t":"同意"},{"w":"track","pos":"v.","def":"to follow where someone goes or what they do","cn":"追蹤","s":"Many free apps ________ what you click and buy, and then they sell this information to advertising companies.","zh":"許多免費應用程式會追蹤你點擊和購買的東西,然後把這些資訊賣給廣告公司。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A42","t":"追蹤"},{"w":"monitor","pos":"v.","def":"to watch or check something over a period of time","cn":"監控;監測","s":"Some companies use software to ________ how long workers spend on each task, but many employees say it feels unfair.","zh":"有些公司使用軟體來監控員工在每項任務上花了多少時間,但許多員工說這感覺不公平。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A43","t":"監控"},{"w":"anonymous","pos":"adj.","def":"with a name that is not known or not shown","cn":"匿名的","s":"The class survey was ________, so students felt free to say what they really thought about using AI for homework.","zh":"這份班級問卷是匿名的,所以學生們能自在地說出他們對用人工智慧寫作業的真實想法。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A44","t":"匿名的"},{"w":"identity","pos":"n.","def":"who a person is; their name and personal details","cn":"身分","s":"Criminals stole her ________ by using her ID number online, and she spent months fixing her bank records.","zh":"罪犯在網路上盜用她的身分證號碼竊取了她的身分,她花了好幾個月才處理好銀行紀錄。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A45","t":"身分"},{"w":"verify","pos":"v.","def":"to check that something is true or correct","cn":"核實;驗證","s":"The bank sends a code to your phone to ________ that it is really you, so strangers cannot easily use your account.","zh":"銀行會傳一組代碼到你的手機來驗證真的是你本人,所以陌生人無法輕易使用你的帳戶。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A46","t":"驗證"},{"w":"authentication","pos":"n.","def":"the process of proving who you are to a system","cn":"身分驗證","s":"Two-step ________ takes a few more seconds, but it makes your social media account much safer from hackers.","zh":"雙重身分驗證多花幾秒鐘,但它能讓你的社群帳號更不容易被駭客入侵。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A47","t":"身分驗證"},{"w":"firewall","pos":"n.","def":"a system that blocks dangerous traffic from the internet","cn":"防火牆","s":"The company set up a stronger ________ after the attack, and since then no strangers have entered its network.","zh":"公司在遭受攻擊後架設了更強的防火牆,從那之後就沒有外人再闖入它的網路。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A48","t":"防火牆"},{"w":"malware","pos":"n.","def":"harmful software that damages computers or steals data","cn":"惡意軟體","s":"I clicked a strange link in a message, and ________ quickly spread through my computer and deleted many files.","zh":"我點了訊息裡一個奇怪的連結,結果惡意軟體迅速擴散到我的電腦並刪除了許多檔案。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A49","t":"惡意軟體"},{"w":"virus","pos":"n.","def":"a program that copies itself and harms computers","cn":"(電腦)病毒","s":"My dad's laptop got a ________ from a free game website, so now it opens strange pop-up windows all the time.","zh":"我爸爸的筆電從一個免費遊戲網站中了病毒,所以現在它一直跳出奇怪的視窗。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A50","t":"病毒"},{"w":"spam","pos":"n.","def":"unwanted messages sent to many people","cn":"垃圾郵件","s":"I get dozens of ________ emails every day, but luckily my email app moves most of them into a separate folder.","zh":"我每天收到幾十封垃圾郵件,但幸好我的郵件程式會把大部分移到另一個資料夾。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A51","t":"垃圾"},{"w":"scam","pos":"n.","def":"a dishonest plan to get money from people","cn":"詐騙","s":"My grandmother almost fell for a phone ________ that used an AI copy of my voice, but she called me to check first.","zh":"我奶奶差點落入一通用人工智慧模仿我聲音的電話詐騙,但她先打電話給我確認。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A52","t":"詐騙"},{"w":"phishing","pos":"n.","def":"fake messages that try to steal passwords or bank details","cn":"網路釣魚","s":"The email looked like it came from our bank, but it was a ________ attack, so I deleted it without clicking anything.","zh":"那封電子郵件看起來像是銀行寄來的,但它其實是網路釣魚攻擊,所以我什麼都沒點就把它刪了。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A53","t":"網路釣魚"},{"w":"cookie","pos":"n.","def":"a small file a website saves to remember your activity","cn":"(網站)Cookie;瀏覽紀錄檔","s":"Every time I open a news website, it asks me to accept ________s, but I usually say no because I do not want to be tracked.","zh":"每次我打開新聞網站,它都會要求我接受Cookie,但我通常會拒絕,因為我不想被追蹤。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A54","t":"Cookie"},{"w":"biometric","pos":"adj.","def":"using body features like fingerprints or faces to identify people","cn":"生物辨識的","s":"The airport now uses ________ gates that scan your face, so passengers can pass through security much more quickly.","zh":"機場現在使用會掃描臉部的生物辨識閘門,所以旅客能更快地通過安檢。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A55","t":"生物辨識"},{"w":"fingerprint","pos":"n.","def":"the pattern of lines on the tip of your finger","cn":"指紋","s":"I unlock my phone with my ________, but it does not work when my hands are wet after swimming.","zh":"我用指紋解鎖手機,但游泳後手濕濕的時候就沒辦法用。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A56","t":"指紋"},{"w":"facial","pos":"adj.","def":"related to the face","cn":"臉部的","s":"Some schools use ________ scanning to take attendance, but many parents think this collects too much personal data.","zh":"有些學校用臉部掃描來點名,但許多家長認為這蒐集了太多個人資料。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A57","t":"臉部"},{"w":"confidential","pos":"adj.","def":"meant to be kept secret","cn":"機密的","s":"The doctor said patient records are ________, so they should never be typed into a public chatbot.","zh":"醫生說病歷是機密的,所以絕不應該輸入到公開的聊天機器人裡。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A58","t":"機密的"},{"w":"safeguard","pos":"v.","def":"to protect something from harm or loss","cn":"保護;捍衛","s":"New laws aim to ________ children's personal information, because young users often share too much online.","zh":"新法律旨在保護兒童的個人資訊,因為年輕使用者經常在網路上分享太多。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A59","t":"保護"},{"w":"backup","pos":"n.","def":"an extra copy of data kept in case the original is lost","cn":"備份","s":"Luckily I had a ________ of my science report, because my laptop broke the night before it was due.","zh":"幸好我有科學報告的備份,因為我的筆電在截止前一晚壞掉了。","part":"A","sec":"Data, Privacy & Security 數據、隱私與安全","lab":"A60","t":"備份"},{"w":"chatbot","pos":"n.","def":"a computer program that talks with people using text or voice","cn":"聊天機器人","s":"When I had a question about my order late at night, a ________ answered me at once, but it could not solve the problem.","zh":"我深夜對訂單有疑問時,一個聊天機器人立刻回覆了我,但它沒辦法解決問題。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A61","t":"聊天機器人"},{"w":"prompt","pos":"n.","def":"the instruction or question you type into an AI tool","cn":"提示詞;指令","s":"If you write a clear ________ with details, the AI gives better answers, but a short vague question often gets a poor reply.","zh":"如果你寫出清楚又有細節的提示詞,人工智慧會給出更好的答案,但簡短模糊的問題常常得到很差的回覆。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A62","t":"提示詞"},{"w":"generative","pos":"adj.","def":"able to create new text, pictures or sound","cn":"生成式的","s":"________ AI can write a poem in seconds, but many teachers say students still need to learn how to write their own.","zh":"生成式人工智慧能在幾秒內寫出一首詩,但許多老師說學生仍需要學會自己寫作。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A63","t":"生成式"},{"w":"deepfake","pos":"n.","def":"a fake video or voice made by AI that looks real","cn":"深偽(影片)","s":"A ________ of a famous singer spread online last week, and many fans believed it until the singer posted a warning.","zh":"上週一段知名歌手的深偽影片在網路上流傳,許多粉絲都信以為真,直到歌手發文警告。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A64","t":"深偽影片"},{"w":"assistant","pos":"n.","def":"a person or program that helps someone do tasks","cn":"助理;助手","s":"I ask the voice ________ on my phone to set alarms and check the weather, so I rarely type these things myself.","zh":"我請手機上的語音助理設定鬧鐘和查天氣,所以我很少自己輸入這些事。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A65","t":"助理"},{"w":"translate","pos":"v.","def":"to change words into another language","cn":"翻譯","s":"Tourists can now ________ menus by pointing their phone camera at them, so ordering food abroad is much easier.","zh":"遊客現在只要把手機鏡頭對準菜單就能翻譯,所以在國外點餐容易多了。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A66","t":"翻譯"},{"w":"summarise","pos":"v.","def":"to give the main points in a short form","cn":"總結;摘要","s":"My classmate asked an AI to ________ the novel for her, but she failed the quiz because she missed important details.","zh":"我同學請人工智慧幫她摘要那本小說,但她因為漏掉了重要細節而考不及格。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A67","t":"摘要"},{"w":"paraphrase","pos":"v.","def":"to say something again using different words","cn":"改寫;換句話說","s":"Students should ________ ideas from websites in their own words, because copying sentences exactly counts as cheating.","zh":"學生應該用自己的話改寫網站上的想法,因為一字不漏地抄句子算是作弊。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A68","t":"改寫"},{"w":"draft","pos":"n.","def":"an early version of a piece of writing","cn":"草稿","s":"The AI helped me write a first ________ of my speech, but I changed most of it so that it sounded like me.","zh":"人工智慧幫我寫出了演講稿的初版草稿,但我改了大部分內容,讓它聽起來像我自己。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A69","t":"草稿"},{"w":"edit","pos":"v.","def":"to correct and improve a piece of writing or a video","cn":"編輯;修改","s":"I usually ________ my essays twice before I hand them in, and this year I also check the grammar with an online tool.","zh":"我交作文前通常會修改兩次,今年我還會用線上工具檢查文法。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A70","t":"修改"},{"w":"avatar","pos":"n.","def":"a picture or character that represents you online","cn":"虛擬化身;大頭貼","s":"In the online English class, each student chooses a cartoon ________, so shy learners feel more relaxed when they speak.","zh":"在線上英文課中,每位學生都會選一個卡通虛擬化身,所以害羞的學習者說話時會比較放鬆。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A71","t":"虛擬化身"},{"w":"app","pos":"n.","def":"a program you download onto a phone or tablet","cn":"應用程式","s":"I use a language-learning ________ for ten minutes every morning, and it reminds me if I forget to practise.","zh":"我每天早上用一個語言學習應用程式十分鐘,如果我忘了練習,它就會提醒我。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A72","t":"應用程式"},{"w":"platform","pos":"n.","def":"a website or service where people share and use content","cn":"平台","s":"The video ________ removed hundreds of fake AI videos, but new ones appeared almost as fast as they were deleted.","zh":"這個影音平台刪除了數百支人工智慧假影片,但新的影片幾乎和被刪除的速度一樣快地冒出來。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A73","t":"平台"},{"w":"download","pos":"v.","def":"to copy files from the internet onto your device","cn":"下載","s":"You can ________ the lecture notes from the school website, so you do not need to copy everything from the board.","zh":"你可以從學校網站下載上課講義,所以不需要把黑板上的東西全部抄下來。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A74","t":"下載"},{"w":"upload","pos":"v.","def":"to send files from your device to the internet","cn":"上傳","s":"Please ________ your project before midnight on Friday, because the system closes automatically after that.","zh":"請在星期五午夜前上傳你的專題,因為系統在那之後會自動關閉。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A75","t":"上傳"},{"w":"browser","pos":"n.","def":"a program used to look at websites","cn":"瀏覽器","s":"My ________ kept showing adverts for shoes I had searched for once, so I cleared my history to stop it.","zh":"我的瀏覽器一直顯示我曾經搜尋過的鞋子廣告,所以我清除了瀏覽紀錄來阻止它。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A76","t":"瀏覽器"},{"w":"subscription","pos":"n.","def":"money you pay regularly to use a service","cn":"訂閱","s":"The premium AI tool needs a monthly ________, but my school pays for it, so students can use it for free.","zh":"進階版人工智慧工具需要每月訂閱,但學校幫我們付費,所以學生可以免費使用。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A77","t":"訂閱"},{"w":"user","pos":"n.","def":"a person who uses a product or service","cn":"使用者;用戶","s":"The app now has over ten million ________s, but the company still has not explained how it stores their data.","zh":"這個應用程式現在有超過一千萬名使用者,但公司仍未說明它如何儲存他們的資料。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A78","t":"使用者"},{"w":"customise","pos":"v.","def":"to change something to suit your own needs","cn":"客製化;自訂","s":"You can ________ the learning app so it shows only the topics you need, and this saves a lot of revision time.","zh":"你可以自訂這個學習應用程式,讓它只顯示你需要的主題,這能省下很多複習時間。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A79","t":"自訂"},{"w":"template","pos":"n.","def":"a ready-made pattern you can use and fill in","cn":"範本;模板","s":"The teacher gave us a ________ for the lab report, so we only had to fill in our results and conclusions.","zh":"老師給了我們一份實驗報告的範本,所以我們只需要填入結果和結論。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A80","t":"範本"},{"w":"keyword","pos":"n.","def":"an important word you type to search for information","cn":"關鍵字","s":"If you type the right ________s into the search box, you will find useful articles much faster than by guessing.","zh":"如果你在搜尋框輸入正確的關鍵字,會比亂猜更快找到有用的文章。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A81","t":"關鍵字"},{"w":"transcribe","pos":"v.","def":"to write down exactly what someone says","cn":"轉錄;謄寫","s":"The app can ________ a whole lecture while the teacher is speaking, so students can read the notes again later.","zh":"這個應用程式能在老師講課時轉錄整堂課,所以學生之後可以再讀一次筆記。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A82","t":"轉錄"},{"w":"caption","pos":"n.","def":"words on a screen that show what people are saying","cn":"字幕;圖說","s":"I turn on the ________s when I watch English videos, because reading and listening together helps me understand more.","zh":"我看英文影片時會打開字幕,因為邊讀邊聽能幫助我理解更多。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A83","t":"字幕"},{"w":"synthetic","pos":"adj.","def":"made artificially, not natural or real","cn":"合成的;人造的","s":"The radio advert used a ________ voice made by AI, and most listeners could not tell that it was not a real person.","zh":"那則廣播廣告使用了人工智慧製作的合成聲音,大多數聽眾都分辨不出那不是真人。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A84","t":"合成"},{"w":"fake","pos":"adj.","def":"not real, but made to look real","cn":"假的;偽造的","s":"The photo of the flooded city looked shocking, but it was ________, so the news channel apologised for showing it.","zh":"那張城市淹水的照片看起來很驚人,但它是假的,所以新聞台為播出這張照片道歉。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A85","t":"假的"},{"w":"clone","pos":"v.","def":"to make an exact copy of something","cn":"複製;仿製","s":"Scammers can now ________ a person's voice from a short video clip, so families should agree on a secret code word.","zh":"詐騙集團現在能從一小段影片複製一個人的聲音,所以家人應該約定一個暗號。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A86","t":"複製"},{"w":"mimic","pos":"v.","def":"to copy the way someone talks or behaves","cn":"模仿","s":"The AI can ________ the writing style of famous authors, but critics say its stories still lack real feeling.","zh":"人工智慧能模仿知名作家的寫作風格,但評論家說它的故事仍缺乏真實的情感。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A87","t":"模仿"},{"w":"realistic","pos":"adj.","def":"looking or seeming very real","cn":"逼真的;寫實的","s":"AI pictures have become so ________ that many people cannot tell them apart from real photos, which worries journalists.","zh":"人工智慧圖片已變得非常逼真,以至於許多人無法把它們和真實照片區分開來,這讓記者們很擔心。","part":"A","sec":"Generative AI & Digital Tools 生成式AI與數位工具","lab":"A88","t":"逼真"},{"w":"curriculum","pos":"n.","def":"all the subjects and topics taught in a school","cn":"課程(綱要)","s":"The government added AI lessons to the high school ________, but many teachers say they need more training first.","zh":"政府把人工智慧課程加入高中課程綱要,但許多老師說他們需要先接受更多培訓。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A89","t":"課程綱要"},{"w":"tutor","pos":"n.","def":"a teacher who helps one student or a small group","cn":"家教;導師","s":"An AI ________ is available all night, but it cannot notice when a student looks tired or upset like a human teacher can.","zh":"人工智慧家教整晚都能使用,但它不像真人老師那樣能察覺學生看起來疲倦或沮喪。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A90","t":"家教"},{"w":"tutoring","pos":"n.","def":"extra private teaching for one student or a small group","cn":"課業輔導;家教","s":"Private ________ is very expensive in Taipei, so some families now try cheaper online AI lessons instead.","zh":"在台北,私人家教非常昂貴,所以一些家庭現在改試更便宜的線上人工智慧課程。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A91","t":"家教"},{"w":"plagiarism","pos":"n.","def":"copying someone else's work and saying it is yours","cn":"抄襲","s":"The university takes ________ very seriously, so students who copy AI essays may fail the whole course.","zh":"這所大學非常嚴肅看待抄襲,所以抄人工智慧作文的學生可能整門課都會被當。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A92","t":"抄襲"},{"w":"plagiarise","pos":"v.","def":"to copy someone else's words or ideas as your own","cn":"抄襲","s":"He ________d a paragraph from a website, and the teacher found it in seconds with a checking tool.","zh":"他從一個網站抄襲了一段文字,老師用檢查工具在幾秒內就發現了。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A93","t":"抄襲"},{"w":"cheat","pos":"v.","def":"to act dishonestly to win or pass a test","cn":"作弊","s":"Some students ________ by using phones during online tests, so the school now asks everyone to keep their cameras on.","zh":"有些學生在線上考試時用手機作弊,所以學校現在要求每個人都要開著鏡頭。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A94","t":"作弊"},{"w":"assignment","pos":"n.","def":"a piece of work given to a student","cn":"作業;任務","s":"Our history ________ is to interview an older relative, so an AI cannot easily do the work for us.","zh":"我們的歷史作業是訪問一位年長的親戚,所以人工智慧很難幫我們完成。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A95","t":"作業"},{"w":"essay","pos":"n.","def":"a short piece of writing on a subject","cn":"文章;作文","s":"The teacher asked us to write the ________ in class by hand, because she wanted to see our real writing skills.","zh":"老師要我們在課堂上手寫這篇作文,因為她想看到我們真正的寫作能力。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A96","t":"作文"},{"w":"homework","pos":"n.","def":"schoolwork that students do at home","cn":"家庭作業","s":"My little brother finished his math ________ in five minutes with an AI app, but he could not explain any of the answers.","zh":"我弟弟用人工智慧應用程式五分鐘就寫完數學作業,但他一個答案都解釋不出來。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A97","t":"作業"},{"w":"assessment","pos":"n.","def":"a test or judgement of how well someone has learned","cn":"評量;評估","s":"Many schools are changing their ________ methods, because take-home essays are now too easy to complete with AI.","zh":"許多學校正在改變評量方式,因為帶回家寫的作文現在太容易用人工智慧完成了。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A98","t":"評量"},{"w":"grade","pos":"v.","def":"to give a mark or score to students' work","cn":"打分數;評分","s":"Some teachers use AI to ________ multiple-choice tests, so they have more time to write comments on students' essays.","zh":"有些老師用人工智慧來評分選擇題測驗,這樣他們就有更多時間在學生作文上寫評語。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A99","t":"評分"},{"w":"literacy","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to read and write, or skill in an area","cn":"讀寫能力;素養","s":"Digital ________ is now as important as reading, because students must judge whether online information is true.","zh":"數位素養現在和閱讀一樣重要,因為學生必須判斷網路資訊是否屬實。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A100","t":"素養"},{"w":"adaptive","pos":"adj.","def":"able to change to suit different needs","cn":"適性的;可調適的","s":"The ________ math program gives harder questions when you answer correctly, but easier ones when you make mistakes.","zh":"這個適性數學程式在你答對時給更難的題目,但在你答錯時給較簡單的題目。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A101","t":"適性"},{"w":"remote","pos":"adj.","def":"done from a distance, not in the same place","cn":"遠距的;遠端的","s":"During the typhoon, the school switched to ________ learning, so students joined their classes from home.","zh":"颱風期間,學校改為遠距教學,所以學生在家上課。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A102","t":"遠距"},{"w":"lecture","pos":"n.","def":"a talk given to students on a subject","cn":"講課;演講","s":"The professor recorded every ________ and posted it online, but fewer students came to class after that.","zh":"教授錄下每一堂講課並放到網路上,但在那之後來上課的學生變少了。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A103","t":"講課"},{"w":"lecturer","pos":"n.","def":"a teacher at a university","cn":"(大學)講師","s":"Our ________ allows us to use AI for brainstorming, but we must explain in writing how we used it.","zh":"我們的講師允許我們用人工智慧腦力激盪,但我們必須書面說明如何使用它。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A104","t":"講師"},{"w":"syllabus","pos":"n.","def":"a list of topics and plans for a course","cn":"課程大綱","s":"The ________ says that AI tools are not allowed in the final exam, so please read it carefully before the term begins.","zh":"課程大綱上寫著期末考不准使用人工智慧工具,所以請在學期開始前仔細閱讀。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A105","t":"課程大綱"},{"w":"enrol","pos":"v.","def":"to officially join a course or school","cn":"註冊;報名","s":"Thousands of adults ________ in free online AI courses every month, because they want to keep their jobs safe.","zh":"每個月有數千名成人報名免費的線上人工智慧課程,因為他們想保住自己的工作。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A106","t":"報名"},{"w":"tuition","pos":"n.","def":"money paid for teaching at a school or university","cn":"學費","s":"University ________ keeps rising, so some students prefer cheaper online courses that use AI teachers.","zh":"大學學費持續上漲,所以有些學生偏好使用人工智慧老師的較便宜線上課程。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A107","t":"學費"},{"w":"coursework","pos":"n.","def":"work students do during a course that counts towards a grade","cn":"課堂作業;平時作業","s":"Half of our final mark comes from ________, so the teacher checks every project carefully for AI-written parts.","zh":"我們期末成績有一半來自平時作業,所以老師會仔細檢查每份專題中是否有人工智慧寫的部分。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A108","t":"平時作業"},{"w":"quiz","pos":"n.","def":"a short test","cn":"小考;測驗","s":"The app gives me a quick vocabulary ________ every evening, and it repeats the words I got wrong the next day.","zh":"這個應用程式每天晚上給我一個快速的單字小考,並且隔天會重複出我答錯的字。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A109","t":"小考"},{"w":"certificate","pos":"n.","def":"an official paper that shows you completed a course","cn":"證書","s":"After the six-week online course, I received a ________ in data skills, and I added it to my job applications.","zh":"上完六週的線上課程後,我拿到一張數據技能證書,並把它加進我的求職資料裡。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A110","t":"證書"},{"w":"graduate","pos":"n.","def":"a person who has finished a degree","cn":"畢業生","s":"Many new ________s find that companies now expect AI skills, so they take extra courses after leaving university.","zh":"許多應屆畢業生發現公司現在要求人工智慧技能,所以他們離開大學後會額外修課。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A111","t":"畢業生"},{"w":"self-paced","pos":"adj.","def":"letting you learn at your own speed","cn":"自主進度的","s":"The course is ________, so busy workers can study at night, but some people never finish without a deadline.","zh":"這門課是自主進度的,所以忙碌的上班族可以晚上學習,但有些人沒有截止日期就永遠讀不完。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A112","t":"自主進度的"},{"w":"interactive","pos":"adj.","def":"allowing people and computers to respond to each other","cn":"互動式的","s":"The ________ whiteboard lets students move pictures and answer questions, so lessons feel more like games.","zh":"這塊互動式白板讓學生移動圖片和回答問題,所以上課感覺更像在玩遊戲。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A113","t":"互動式"},{"w":"detector","pos":"n.","def":"a tool that finds or notices something","cn":"偵測器;檢測工具","s":"The school uses an AI ________ to check essays, but it sometimes marks honest students' work as machine-written.","zh":"學校使用人工智慧檢測工具檢查作文,但它有時會把誠實學生的作品標記成機器寫的。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A114","t":"檢測工具"},{"w":"originality","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being new and not copied","cn":"原創性","s":"The judges gave her the top prize for ________, because her story idea was unlike anything they had read before.","zh":"評審因為原創性給了她最高獎項,因為她的故事點子和他們以前讀過的都不一樣。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A115","t":"原創性"},{"w":"dishonest","pos":"adj.","def":"not telling the truth; likely to cheat","cn":"不誠實的","s":"Handing in an AI essay as your own work is ________, and it also means you lose the chance to improve your writing.","zh":"把人工智慧寫的作文當成自己的作品交出去是不誠實的,而且也代表你失去了提升寫作的機會。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A116","t":"不誠實的"},{"w":"mentor","pos":"n.","def":"an experienced person who advises someone younger","cn":"導師;良師","s":"An AI can answer questions, but a good ________ shares real experience and helps you make big life decisions.","zh":"人工智慧能回答問題,但一位好的導師會分享真實的經驗,並幫助你做出人生的重大決定。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A117","t":"導師"},{"w":"textbook","pos":"n.","def":"a book used for studying a subject","cn":"教科書;課本","s":"The new English ________ comes with an app that reads every dialogue aloud, so students can practise speaking at home.","zh":"新的英文課本附有一個會朗讀每段對話的應用程式,所以學生可以在家練習口說。","part":"A","sec":"AI in the Classroom 人工智慧與教育","lab":"A118","t":"課本"},{"w":"workforce","pos":"n.","def":"all the people who work in a company or country","cn":"勞動力;全體員工","s":"As the ________ gets older, Taiwan is using more robots in factories, but it still needs young skilled workers.","zh":"隨著勞動力高齡化,台灣在工廠裡使用更多機器人,但仍然需要年輕的技術人才。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A119","t":"勞動力"},{"w":"employment","pos":"n.","def":"having paid work","cn":"就業;雇用","s":"AI may reduce ________ in some office jobs, but it is also creating new jobs that did not exist ten years ago.","zh":"人工智慧可能會減少某些辦公室工作的就業機會,但它也創造了十年前不存在的新工作。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A120","t":"就業"},{"w":"unemployment","pos":"n.","def":"the state of not having a job","cn":"失業","s":"Some experts fear that ________ will rise as machines take over simple tasks, while others expect new kinds of work to appear.","zh":"有些專家擔心隨著機器接手簡單的工作,失業率會上升,而其他人則預期會出現新型態的工作。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A121","t":"失業"},{"w":"redundant","pos":"adj.","def":"no longer needed for a job, so dismissed","cn":"被裁員的;多餘的","s":"Fifty call-centre workers were made ________ after the company started using AI to answer phone calls.","zh":"在公司開始使用人工智慧接聽電話後,五十名客服中心員工被裁員了。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A122","t":"被裁員"},{"w":"layoff","pos":"n.","def":"the act of ending workers' jobs because there is not enough work","cn":"裁員","s":"The tech firm announced a big ________ last month, so many young engineers are now looking for new positions.","zh":"這家科技公司上個月宣布了大規模裁員,所以許多年輕工程師現在正在找新職位。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A123","t":"裁員"},{"w":"replace","pos":"v.","def":"to take the place of someone or something","cn":"取代","s":"Self-service machines have ________d many cashiers in supermarkets, but customers still ask staff for help with problems.","zh":"自助機器已經取代了超市裡許多收銀員,但顧客遇到問題時仍會向店員求助。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A124","t":"取代"},{"w":"productivity","pos":"n.","def":"how much work is done in a certain time","cn":"生產力","s":"Office ________ rose after the team began using AI to write reports, so the manager gave everyone a shorter Friday.","zh":"團隊開始用人工智慧寫報告後,辦公室的生產力提升了,所以經理讓大家星期五提早下班。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A125","t":"生產力"},{"w":"efficiency","pos":"n.","def":"doing something well without wasting time or energy","cn":"效率","s":"The delivery company uses AI to plan routes, and this ________ saves fuel and gets parcels to customers sooner.","zh":"這家物流公司用人工智慧規劃路線,這樣的效率能節省燃料,並讓包裹更快送到顧客手上。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A126","t":"效率"},{"w":"outsource","pos":"v.","def":"to pay another company to do some of your work","cn":"外包","s":"Many small shops ________ their accounting to online services, because hiring a full-time accountant costs too much.","zh":"許多小商店把會計工作外包給線上服務,因為聘請全職會計師的成本太高。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A127","t":"外包"},{"w":"freelance","pos":"adj.","def":"working for different companies, not employed by one","cn":"自由接案的","s":"She is a ________ designer, so she worries that AI image tools may take away some of her clients.","zh":"她是一位自由接案的設計師,所以她擔心人工智慧繪圖工具可能會搶走她的一些客戶。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A128","t":"自由接案的"},{"w":"gig","pos":"n.","def":"a short job or piece of paid work","cn":"零工;臨時工作","s":"Many students do ________ work like food delivery, because the hours are flexible, but the pay is not stable.","zh":"許多學生做外送之類的零工,因為時間有彈性,但收入並不穩定。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A129","t":"零工"},{"w":"retrain","pos":"v.","def":"to learn or teach new skills for a different job","cn":"再培訓;重新訓練","s":"The government pays factory workers to ________ as technicians, so they can find jobs that machines cannot do.","zh":"政府出錢讓工廠工人重新受訓成為技術人員,這樣他們就能找到機器做不來的工作。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A130","t":"重新受訓"},{"w":"upskill","pos":"v.","def":"to learn new skills to do your job better","cn":"提升技能","s":"Our company asked all staff to ________ in data analysis, because managers now expect reports with clear charts.","zh":"我們公司要求全體員工在資料分析方面提升技能,因為主管現在期望報告附有清楚的圖表。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A131","t":"提升技能"},{"w":"wage","pos":"n.","def":"money paid to a worker, usually by the hour or week","cn":"工資","s":"Some workers fear that their ________s will fall if robots can do the same job for less money.","zh":"有些工人擔心,如果機器人能用更少的錢做同樣的工作,他們的工資會下降。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A132","t":"工資"},{"w":"salary","pos":"n.","def":"fixed money paid to a worker every month","cn":"薪水","s":"AI engineers earn a very high ________, so many university students now want to study computer science.","zh":"人工智慧工程師的薪水非常高,所以現在許多大學生都想念資訊工程。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A133","t":"薪水"},{"w":"profit","pos":"n.","def":"money a business makes after paying its costs","cn":"利潤;獲利","s":"The online shop's ________s grew quickly after it used AI to suggest products, but some customers found the ads annoying.","zh":"這家網路商店用人工智慧推薦商品後獲利快速成長,但有些顧客覺得廣告很煩人。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A134","t":"獲利"},{"w":"startup","pos":"n.","def":"a new small company, often in technology","cn":"新創公司","s":"My friend works at an AI ________ in Taipei, and although the hours are long, she is learning a lot.","zh":"我朋友在台北一家人工智慧新創公司工作,雖然工時很長,但她學到很多。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A135","t":"新創公司"},{"w":"entrepreneur","pos":"n.","def":"a person who starts their own business","cn":"創業家;企業家","s":"The young ________ used AI to design her logo and website, so she opened her online shop with very little money.","zh":"這位年輕的創業家用人工智慧設計標誌和網站,所以她只花很少的錢就開了網路商店。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A136","t":"創業家"},{"w":"investor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who puts money into a business to make more money","cn":"投資人","s":"Many ________s are putting money into AI companies, but some warn that the market may be growing too fast.","zh":"許多投資人正把錢投入人工智慧公司,但有些人警告市場可能成長得太快了。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A137","t":"投資人"},{"w":"manufacturing","pos":"n.","def":"making goods in large numbers in factories","cn":"製造業","s":"Robots now do many dangerous jobs in ________, so fewer workers are hurt, but the factories need fewer people.","zh":"機器人現在在製造業中做許多危險的工作,所以受傷的工人變少了,但工廠需要的人力也減少了。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A138","t":"製造業"},{"w":"warehouse","pos":"n.","def":"a large building where goods are stored","cn":"倉庫","s":"In the online shop's ________, robots carry the shelves to the workers, so packing an order takes only a few minutes.","zh":"在這家網路商店的倉庫裡,機器人把貨架搬到員工面前,所以包裝一張訂單只需要幾分鐘。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A139","t":"倉庫"},{"w":"labour","pos":"n.","def":"work, especially physical work; workers as a group","cn":"勞力;勞工","s":"Farms are using drones and robots because there is not enough ________ in the countryside, and young people prefer city jobs.","zh":"農場正在使用無人機和機器人,因為鄉下的勞力不足,而且年輕人比較喜歡城市的工作。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A140","t":"勞力"},{"w":"career","pos":"n.","def":"the jobs a person does during their working life","cn":"職涯;事業","s":"My sister changed her ________ from accounting to data science, because she believed AI would change her old job.","zh":"我姐姐把她的職涯從會計轉向資料科學,因為她相信人工智慧會改變她原本的工作。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A141","t":"職涯"},{"w":"obsolete","pos":"adj.","def":"no longer used because something newer exists","cn":"過時的;淘汰的","s":"Some skills, like typing fast, may become ________, but skills like teamwork will still be needed in the future.","zh":"有些技能,例如快速打字,可能會變得過時,但團隊合作之類的技能未來仍然會被需要。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A142","t":"過時"},{"w":"applicant","pos":"n.","def":"a person who applies for a job or place","cn":"申請人;應徵者","s":"Each job ________ must complete an online test, and an AI system reads the answers before a manager sees them.","zh":"每位應徵者都必須完成線上測驗,而人工智慧系統會在經理看到之前先讀過答案。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A143","t":"應徵者"},{"w":"recruiter","pos":"n.","def":"a person who finds new workers for companies","cn":"招募人員","s":"The ________ said she now uses AI to sort hundreds of CVs, but she still meets the final candidates in person.","zh":"這位招募人員說她現在用人工智慧整理數百份履歷,但她仍會親自面試最後的人選。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A144","t":"招募人員"},{"w":"shortage","pos":"n.","def":"a situation where there is not enough of something","cn":"短缺;不足","s":"There is a ________ of nurses in many hospitals, so robots now deliver medicine, but patients still need human care.","zh":"許多醫院護理師短缺,所以現在由機器人遞送藥物,但病人仍然需要人的照顧。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A145","t":"短缺"},{"w":"employer","pos":"n.","def":"a person or company that pays people to work","cn":"雇主","s":"Many ________s now ask whether job seekers can use AI tools, so students should learn these skills before graduating.","zh":"許多雇主現在會詢問求職者是否會使用人工智慧工具,所以學生應該在畢業前學會這些技能。","part":"A","sec":"Work, Jobs & the Economy 工作、就業與經濟","lab":"A146","t":"雇主"},{"w":"ethics","pos":"n.","def":"moral rules about what is right and wrong","cn":"倫理;道德規範","s":"Our class discussed the ________ of using AI in hospitals, because a wrong decision by a machine could hurt a patient.","zh":"我們班討論了在醫院使用人工智慧的倫理問題,因為機器做出錯誤決定可能會傷害病人。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A147","t":"倫理"},{"w":"ethical","pos":"adj.","def":"morally right or acceptable","cn":"合乎道德的;倫理的","s":"Is it ________ to use AI to write a love letter, or should those words always come from your own heart?","zh":"用人工智慧寫情書是合乎道德的嗎?還是那些話應該永遠出自你自己的內心?","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A148","t":"合乎道德的"},{"w":"bias","pos":"n.","def":"unfair support for or against a group","cn":"偏見;偏差","s":"The hiring program showed ________ against women, because it had learned from old records in which most staff were men.","zh":"這個招聘程式顯示出對女性的偏見,因為它是從大多數員工都是男性的舊紀錄中學習的。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A149","t":"偏見"},{"w":"biased","pos":"adj.","def":"unfairly favouring one side or group","cn":"有偏見的;偏頗的","s":"The AI gave ________ answers about some countries, so the teacher reminded us to compare several sources.","zh":"人工智慧對某些國家給出了偏頗的答案,所以老師提醒我們要比較多個資料來源。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A150","t":"偏頗的"},{"w":"discriminate","pos":"v.","def":"to treat a person or group unfairly","cn":"歧視","s":"Banks must make sure their AI does not ________ against older people, because everyone deserves a fair chance at a loan.","zh":"銀行必須確保它們的人工智慧不會歧視年長者,因為每個人都應該有公平申請貸款的機會。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A151","t":"歧視"},{"w":"discrimination","pos":"n.","def":"unfair treatment of people because of who they are","cn":"歧視","s":"Some job seekers faced ________ because of their accent, so the company stopped using the voice-checking software.","zh":"有些求職者因為口音而受到歧視,所以公司停止使用那個語音檢測軟體。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A152","t":"歧視"},{"w":"fairness","pos":"n.","def":"treating people equally and in the right way","cn":"公平","s":"Parents questioned the ________ of AI grading, because their children received low scores for creative but unusual answers.","zh":"家長質疑人工智慧評分的公平性,因為他們的孩子因富有創意但不尋常的答案而拿到低分。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A153","t":"公平性"},{"w":"transparent","pos":"adj.","def":"open and easy to understand, with nothing hidden","cn":"透明的;公開的","s":"Companies should be ________ about how their AI makes decisions, so users can understand why they were refused.","zh":"公司應該對人工智慧如何做決定保持透明,這樣使用者才能理解自己為何被拒絕。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A154","t":"透明"},{"w":"transparency","pos":"n.","def":"openness about how decisions are made","cn":"透明度","s":"The public is asking for more ________ from tech companies, because nobody knows exactly what data their AI was trained on.","zh":"大眾要求科技公司提高透明度,因為沒有人確切知道它們的人工智慧是用什麼資料訓練的。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A155","t":"透明度"},{"w":"accountable","pos":"adj.","def":"responsible for your actions and able to explain them","cn":"應負責任的","s":"If a self-driving car causes an accident, who should be held ________, the driver or the company that made it?","zh":"如果自駕車造成事故,誰該負責,是駕駛還是製造它的公司?","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A156","t":"負責"},{"w":"accountability","pos":"n.","def":"being responsible for decisions and their results","cn":"問責;責任歸屬","s":"There is little ________ when an algorithm makes a mistake, so lawmakers want clear rules about who must pay.","zh":"當演算法出錯時幾乎沒有責任歸屬,所以立法者希望明確規定誰必須賠償。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A157","t":"責任歸屬"},{"w":"regulate","pos":"v.","def":"to control something with official rules","cn":"規範;管制","s":"Many countries are trying to ________ AI, but technology changes so quickly that new laws are soon out of date.","zh":"許多國家正試圖規範人工智慧,但科技變化太快,新法律很快就過時了。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A158","t":"規範"},{"w":"regulator","pos":"n.","def":"an official group that makes sure rules are followed","cn":"監管機構","s":"The ________ fined the app company because it had collected children's voices without asking their parents.","zh":"監管機構對這家應用程式公司開罰,因為它沒有詢問家長就蒐集了兒童的聲音。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A159","t":"監管機構"},{"w":"legislation","pos":"n.","def":"a law or group of laws","cn":"法規;立法","s":"New ________ requires AI-made videos to carry a label, so viewers know that what they are watching is not real.","zh":"新的法規要求人工智慧製作的影片必須加上標示,讓觀眾知道他們看的不是真的。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A160","t":"法規"},{"w":"ban","pos":"v.","def":"to officially say something is not allowed","cn":"禁止","s":"Some schools ________ phones during lessons, while others allow them because students use them for learning apps.","zh":"有些學校在上課時禁止使用手機,而其他學校則允許,因為學生會用它們來使用學習應用程式。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A161","t":"禁止"},{"w":"copyright","pos":"n.","def":"the legal right to own and control creative work","cn":"著作權;版權","s":"Artists say AI companies broke ________ laws by using their paintings to train machines, and some have gone to court.","zh":"藝術家們說人工智慧公司用他們的畫作訓練機器違反了著作權法,有些人已經告上法院。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A162","t":"著作權"},{"w":"misuse","pos":"v.","def":"to use something in a wrong or harmful way","cn":"濫用;誤用","s":"If people ________ AI to make fake news, it becomes harder for everyone to trust what they read online.","zh":"如果人們濫用人工智慧製造假新聞,每個人就更難相信他們在網路上讀到的內容。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A163","t":"濫用"},{"w":"manipulate","pos":"v.","def":"to control people or facts in a dishonest way","cn":"操弄;操縱","s":"Some apps ________ users into spending more time online, because the companies earn more money from longer visits.","zh":"有些應用程式操弄使用者花更多時間上網,因為公司能從更長的瀏覽時間中賺更多錢。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A164","t":"操弄"},{"w":"manipulation","pos":"n.","def":"dishonest control of people, facts or images","cn":"操縱;竄改","s":"Photo ________ is now so easy with AI that a single image can no longer prove that something really happened.","zh":"有了人工智慧,照片竄改變得非常容易,以至於單一張圖片已無法證明某件事真的發生過。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A165","t":"竄改"},{"w":"responsible","pos":"adj.","def":"careful and sensible in how you behave","cn":"負責任的","s":"A ________ AI user checks facts before sharing them, because chatbots sometimes give answers that sound right but are wrong.","zh":"一位負責任的人工智慧使用者在分享前會先查核事實,因為聊天機器人有時會給出聽起來正確但其實錯誤的答案。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A166","t":"負責任的"},{"w":"oversight","pos":"n.","def":"the job of watching and checking that something is done properly","cn":"監督","s":"Doctors say AI must work under human ________, because a computer cannot take responsibility for a patient's life.","zh":"醫生們說人工智慧必須在人類的監督下運作,因為電腦無法為病人的生命負責。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A167","t":"監督"},{"w":"guideline","pos":"n.","def":"advice or a rule about how to do something","cn":"指引;準則","s":"The school published clear ________s on AI use, so students know when it is allowed and when it counts as cheating.","zh":"學校公布了清楚的人工智慧使用準則,讓學生知道什麼時候可以用、什麼時候算作弊。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A168","t":"準則"},{"w":"loophole","pos":"n.","def":"a gap in a rule that lets people avoid it","cn":"漏洞","s":"The company found a ________ in the law, so it could keep users' data for years without breaking any rules.","zh":"這家公司找到法律的漏洞,所以它能保存使用者的資料好幾年而不違反任何規定。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A169","t":"漏洞"},{"w":"lawsuit","pos":"n.","def":"a case brought to a court of law","cn":"訴訟","s":"A group of writers started a ________ against the AI firm, because it had used their books without paying them.","zh":"一群作家對這家人工智慧公司提起訴訟,因為它未付費就使用了他們的書。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A170","t":"訴訟"},{"w":"prejudice","pos":"n.","def":"an unfair opinion formed without enough knowledge","cn":"偏見;成見","s":"AI systems can repeat human ________ if they learn from unfair data, so developers must test them very carefully.","zh":"如果人工智慧系統從不公平的資料中學習,就可能複製人類的偏見,所以開發者必須非常仔細地測試它們。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A171","t":"偏見"},{"w":"stereotype","pos":"n.","def":"a fixed, too-simple idea about a group of people","cn":"刻板印象","s":"When we asked the AI to draw a nurse, it always drew a woman, which shows a common gender ________.","zh":"當我們請人工智慧畫一位護理師時,它總是畫出女性,這顯示了一種常見的性別刻板印象。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A172","t":"刻板印象"},{"w":"exploit","pos":"v.","def":"to use someone or something unfairly for your own gain","cn":"剝削;利用","s":"Some companies ________ low-paid workers to label training data, and these workers often see upsetting images all day.","zh":"有些公司剝削低薪工人來標記訓練資料,而這些工人經常整天看到令人不安的圖片。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A173","t":"剝削"},{"w":"misinformation","pos":"n.","def":"wrong information that is spread, often by mistake","cn":"錯誤訊息","s":"During the election, ________ spread quickly on social media, so many voters were confused about the real facts.","zh":"選舉期間,錯誤訊息在社群媒體上迅速散播,所以許多選民對真實情況感到困惑。","part":"A","sec":"Ethics, Bias & Regulation 倫理、偏見與規範","lab":"A174","t":"錯誤訊息"},{"w":"smartphone","pos":"n.","def":"a mobile phone that can use the internet and apps","cn":"智慧型手機","s":"Almost every teenager in Taiwan owns a ________, so schools must teach them how to use AI apps wisely.","zh":"台灣幾乎每個青少年都有一支智慧型手機,所以學校必須教他們如何明智地使用人工智慧應用程式。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A175","t":"智慧型手機"},{"w":"gadget","pos":"n.","def":"a small useful machine or tool","cn":"小裝置;小玩意兒","s":"My dad loves new ________s, so he bought a smart speaker, but he mostly uses it to play old songs.","zh":"我爸爸很喜歡新奇的小裝置,所以他買了一台智慧音箱,但他大多只用它來播老歌。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A176","t":"小裝置"},{"w":"wearable","pos":"adj.","def":"designed to be worn on the body","cn":"可穿戴的","s":"My grandmother wears a ________ device on her wrist, and it calls my mum automatically if she falls down.","zh":"我奶奶手腕上戴著一個穿戴式裝置,如果她跌倒,它會自動打電話給我媽媽。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A177","t":"穿戴式"},{"w":"convenience","pos":"n.","def":"being easy and useful, saving time","cn":"便利","s":"Online shopping offers great ________, but some people miss the fun of visiting real shops with friends.","zh":"網路購物提供了極大的便利,但有些人懷念和朋友一起逛實體店的樂趣。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A178","t":"便利"},{"w":"convenient","pos":"adj.","def":"easy and saving you time or trouble","cn":"方便的","s":"It is ________ to ask a smart speaker for the weather, but it is a little worrying that it is always listening.","zh":"問智慧音箱天氣很方便,但它總是在聆聽這件事有點令人擔憂。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A179","t":"方便"},{"w":"inequality","pos":"n.","def":"an unfair difference between groups of people","cn":"不平等","s":"AI could increase ________ if only rich schools can afford the best tools, so the government wants to help poorer areas.","zh":"如果只有富裕的學校負擔得起最好的工具,人工智慧可能會加劇不平等,所以政府想幫助較貧困的地區。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A180","t":"不平等"},{"w":"divide","pos":"n.","def":"a large difference between two groups","cn":"差距;鴻溝","s":"There is a growing ________ between students who have fast internet at home and those who do not.","zh":"家裡有高速網路的學生和沒有的學生之間差距越來越大。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A181","t":"差距"},{"w":"accessible","pos":"adj.","def":"easy to reach, use or understand","cn":"易取得的;無障礙的","s":"AI reading tools make books more ________ to blind students, because the computer can read every page aloud.","zh":"人工智慧閱讀工具讓盲人學生更容易取得書籍,因為電腦能把每一頁都朗讀出來。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A182","t":"容易取得"},{"w":"companionship","pos":"n.","def":"the pleasure of having friendly company","cn":"陪伴;友誼","s":"Some lonely older people find ________ in talking robots, but experts say real friends are still much more important.","zh":"一些孤單的長者從會說話的機器人身上得到陪伴,但專家說真正的朋友仍然重要得多。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A183","t":"陪伴"},{"w":"dependence on","pos":"n.","def":"needing something so much that you cannot do without it","cn":"依賴","s":"Too much ________ on GPS has made some drivers forget how to read a map, and AI may have the same effect on writing.","zh":"過度依賴衛星導航已讓一些駕駛忘了怎麼看地圖,而人工智慧對寫作可能也有同樣的影響。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A184","t":"依賴"},{"w":"Be dependent on","pos":"adj.","def":"needing someone or something to survive or work","cn":"依賴的","s":"Many students have become ________ on AI for their homework, so they struggle when they must write without it in exams.","zh":"許多學生寫作業已變得依賴人工智慧,所以在考試中必須自己寫時就很吃力。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A185","t":"依賴"},{"w":"innovation","pos":"n.","def":"a new idea, method or invention","cn":"創新","s":"AI is a major ________ in medicine, and it can now spot some diseases in X-rays earlier than many doctors.","zh":"人工智慧是醫學上的一大創新,它現在能比許多醫生更早在X光片中發現某些疾病。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A186","t":"創新"},{"w":"innovative","pos":"adj.","def":"using new ideas or methods","cn":"創新的","s":"The teacher had an ________ idea: students had to find and correct the mistakes in an AI-written essay.","zh":"這位老師有個創新的點子:學生必須找出並改正一篇人工智慧寫的作文中的錯誤。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A187","t":"創新的"},{"w":"futuristic","pos":"adj.","def":"very modern and seeming to come from the future","cn":"未來感的","s":"The new train station looks very ________, with robots giving directions and screens that speak many languages.","zh":"新的火車站看起來非常有未來感,有機器人指路,還有會說多種語言的螢幕。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A188","t":"未來感"},{"w":"revolutionise","pos":"v.","def":"to change something completely and in a big way","cn":"徹底改變","s":"Experts believe AI will ________ medicine, because it can study millions of patient records in just a few hours.","zh":"專家相信人工智慧將徹底改變醫學,因為它能在短短幾小時內研究數百萬份病歷。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A189","t":"徹底改變"},{"w":"transform","pos":"v.","def":"to change something completely, usually to improve it","cn":"改變;轉變","s":"Smartphones ________ed the way we communicate, and now AI is changing the way we search, learn and work.","zh":"智慧型手機改變了我們溝通的方式,而現在人工智慧正在改變我們搜尋、學習和工作的方式。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A190","t":"改變"},{"w":"transformation","pos":"n.","def":"a complete change in something","cn":"轉型;轉變","s":"The bank went through a digital ________, so customers now do almost everything online instead of visiting a branch.","zh":"這家銀行經歷了數位轉型,所以顧客現在幾乎所有事都在網路上辦理,而不必去分行。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A191","t":"轉型"},{"w":"driverless","pos":"adj.","def":"working without a human driver","cn":"無人駕駛的","s":"________ buses are being tested in some Taiwanese cities, but a safety officer still sits on board in case of problems.","zh":"台灣一些城市正在測試無人駕駛公車,但仍有一位安全人員坐在車上以防出問題。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A192","t":"無人駕駛"},{"w":"autonomous","pos":"adj.","def":"able to work or decide without human control","cn":"自主的;自動的","s":"The ________ vacuum cleaner maps our apartment by itself, so it cleans every room while we are at school.","zh":"這台自動掃地機會自己繪製我們家的地圖,所以它在我們上學時就把每個房間打掃乾淨。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A193","t":"自動"},{"w":"drone","pos":"n.","def":"a small aircraft without a pilot, controlled from the ground","cn":"無人機","s":"Farmers use ________s to spray crops, and this saves time, although some neighbours complain about the noise.","zh":"農夫用無人機噴灑農作物,這節省了時間,雖然有些鄰居抱怨噪音。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A194","t":"無人機"},{"w":"healthcare","pos":"n.","def":"services for looking after people's health","cn":"醫療照護","s":"AI could make ________ cheaper and faster, but patients still want to speak to a real doctor about serious problems.","zh":"人工智慧可能讓醫療照護更便宜、更快速,但病人遇到嚴重問題時仍想和真正的醫生談。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A195","t":"醫療照護"},{"w":"telemedicine","pos":"n.","def":"seeing a doctor through video or phone instead of in person","cn":"遠距醫療","s":"________ helps people on small islands, because they can talk to city doctors without taking a long boat trip.","zh":"遠距醫療幫助住在小島上的人,因為他們不用搭很久的船就能和城市裡的醫生交談。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A196","t":"遠距醫療"},{"w":"e-commerce","pos":"n.","def":"buying and selling goods on the internet","cn":"電子商務","s":"________ has grown quickly in Taiwan, and AI now helps online shops guess what customers will want to buy next.","zh":"電子商務在台灣快速成長,而人工智慧現在幫助網路商店猜測顧客接下來會想買什麼。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A197","t":"電子商務"},{"w":"dystopian","pos":"adj.","def":"describing a frightening imagined future where life is bad","cn":"反烏托邦的","s":"The film shows a ________ world where machines control people, but the director says it is a warning, not a prediction.","zh":"這部電影描繪了一個由機器控制人類的反烏托邦世界,但導演說這是警告,而不是預言。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A198","t":"反烏托邦"},{"w":"sceptical","pos":"adj.","def":"doubting whether something is true or useful","cn":"懷疑的","s":"My grandfather is ________ about AI doctors, because he believes a machine cannot understand how a patient really feels.","zh":"我爺爺對人工智慧醫生抱持懷疑態度,因為他認為機器無法理解病人真正的感受。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A199","t":"懷疑"},{"w":"household","pos":"n.","def":"all the people who live together in one home","cn":"家庭;家戶","s":"Nearly every ________ in our building now has a smart lock, so residents open their doors with their phones.","zh":"我們大樓裡幾乎每一戶現在都有智慧門鎖,所以住戶用手機開門。","part":"A","sec":"Society, Daily Life & the Future 社會、日常生活與未來","lab":"A200","t":"戶"},{"w":"analyse","pos":"v.","def":"to study something carefully to understand it","cn":"分析","s":"AI can ________ thousands of test results in seconds, so teachers can quickly see which topics the class finds difficult.","zh":"人工智慧能在幾秒內分析數千筆測驗結果,所以老師能很快看出全班覺得哪些主題困難。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"分析"},{"w":"substantial","pos":"adj.","def":"large in amount or importance","cn":"大量的;可觀的","s":"The school spent a ________ amount of money on new tablets, but many teachers still prefer paper and pens.","zh":"學校花了可觀的金額購買新平板,但許多老師仍偏好紙筆。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"可觀的"},{"w":"undermine","pos":"v.","def":"to slowly make something weaker","cn":"逐漸削弱;破壞","s":"Fake AI videos can ________ public trust in the news, because people start to doubt even true reports.","zh":"人工智慧假影片會削弱大眾對新聞的信任,因為人們開始連真實的報導都懷疑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"削弱"},{"w":"allocate","pos":"v.","def":"to give money, time or resources for a purpose","cn":"分配;撥款","s":"The city will ________ more money to teacher training, because new tools are useless if nobody knows how to use them.","zh":"市政府將撥更多經費給教師培訓,因為如果沒有人會用,新工具就毫無用處。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"撥"},{"w":"controversial","pos":"adj.","def":"causing a lot of disagreement","cn":"有爭議的","s":"Using AI cameras in classrooms is ________, because some parents feel safer while others think it invades privacy.","zh":"在教室使用人工智慧攝影機是有爭議的,因為有些家長覺得比較安心,而其他人認為這侵犯隱私。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"有爭議的"},{"w":"approach","pos":"n.","def":"a way of dealing with something","cn":"方法;途徑","s":"Our teacher's ________ is simple: we can use AI to find ideas, but we must write every sentence ourselves.","zh":"我們老師的方法很簡單:我們可以用人工智慧找點子,但每個句子都必須自己寫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"方法"},{"w":"evaluate","pos":"v.","def":"to judge how good or useful something is","cn":"評估","s":"Students should ________ every website they use, because not all online information is accurate or up to date.","zh":"學生應該評估他們使用的每個網站,因為並非所有網路資訊都正確或最新。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"評估"},{"w":"significant","pos":"adj.","def":"large or important enough to notice","cn":"顯著的;重大的","s":"There was a ________ rise in online shopping after the pandemic, and many shops never went back to their old ways.","zh":"疫情過後網路購物出現顯著的成長,許多商店再也沒有回到原本的經營方式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"顯著的"},{"w":"crucial","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely important","cn":"極重要的;關鍵的","s":"It is ________ to check AI answers carefully, because one wrong fact in a report can make readers doubt the whole thing.","zh":"仔細檢查人工智慧的答案是極為重要的,因為報告中一個錯誤的事實就可能讓讀者懷疑整份報告。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"極為重要的"},{"w":"enhance","pos":"v.","def":"to improve the quality of something","cn":"提升;增強","s":"Good pictures and videos can ________ a lesson, but too many screens may make students less active in class.","zh":"好的圖片和影片能提升一堂課的品質,但太多螢幕可能讓學生在課堂上變得不積極。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"提升"},{"w":"facilitate","pos":"v.","def":"to make an action or process easier","cn":"促進;使便利","s":"Online forums ________ discussion between students from different schools, so they can share ideas without meeting in person.","zh":"線上論壇促進了不同學校學生之間的討論,讓他們不必見面就能分享想法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"促進"},{"w":"implement","pos":"v.","def":"to start using a plan or system","cn":"實施;執行","s":"The school will ________ the new AI rules next term, but teachers first want to hear what students think.","zh":"學校將在下學期實施新的人工智慧規定,但老師們想先聽聽學生的想法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"實施"},{"w":"incorporate","pos":"v.","def":"to include something as part of a larger thing","cn":"納入;結合","s":"Our teacher tries to ________ games into every lesson, because she believes students remember more when they have fun.","zh":"我們老師試著把遊戲融入每一堂課,因為她相信學生在玩得開心時會記得更多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"融入"},{"w":"adopt","pos":"v.","def":"to start using a new idea or method","cn":"採用","s":"Many companies ________ed AI tools very quickly, but they did not always train their staff to use them safely.","zh":"許多公司很快就採用了人工智慧工具,但它們並不總是訓練員工安全地使用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"採用"},{"w":"emerge","pos":"v.","def":"to appear or become known","cn":"出現;浮現","s":"New AI tools ________ almost every week, so it is hard for schools to keep their rules up to date.","zh":"新的人工智慧工具幾乎每週都會出現,所以學校很難讓規定跟上時代。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"出現"},{"w":"trend","pos":"n.","def":"a general direction in which things are changing","cn":"趨勢","s":"One clear ________ is that young people search for information on video apps rather than on traditional websites.","zh":"一個明顯的趨勢是,年輕人在影音應用程式上搜尋資訊,而不是在傳統網站上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"趨勢"},{"w":"phenomenon","pos":"n.","def":"something that happens and can be observed","cn":"現象","s":"The fast spread of AI chatbots is a global ________, and it is changing how people study, work and shop.","zh":"人工智慧聊天機器人的快速普及是一個全球現象,它正在改變人們學習、工作和購物的方式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"現象"},{"w":"widespread","pos":"adj.","def":"happening in many places or among many people","cn":"普遍的;廣泛的","s":"The use of AI for homework is now ________, so teachers are designing tasks that require personal experience.","zh":"用人工智慧寫作業現在已經很普遍,所以老師們正在設計需要個人經驗的作業。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"普遍"},{"w":"inevitable","pos":"adj.","def":"certain to happen and impossible to avoid","cn":"不可避免的","s":"Some changes to jobs are ________ as AI improves, so young people should keep learning new skills.","zh":"隨著人工智慧進步,工作上的某些改變是不可避免的,所以年輕人應該持續學習新技能。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"不可避免的"},{"w":"potential","pos":"n.","def":"the possibility of developing or being useful in the future","cn":"潛力;可能性","s":"AI has great ________ to help children in poor areas, but only if they have computers and internet at home.","zh":"人工智慧有很大的潛力幫助貧困地區的孩子,但前提是他們家裡要有電腦和網路。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"潛力"},{"w":"enormous","pos":"adj.","def":"very large","cn":"巨大的;龐大的","s":"AI data centres use an ________ amount of electricity, so some people worry about the effect on the environment.","zh":"人工智慧資料中心使用龐大的電量,所以有些人擔心它對環境的影響。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"龐大的"},{"w":"considerable","pos":"adj.","def":"fairly large in size or amount","cn":"相當大的","s":"Learning to use the new system took ________ time, but after a month the office staff were working much faster.","zh":"學習使用新系統花了相當多的時間,但一個月後辦公室員工的工作速度快了許多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"相當多的"},{"w":"dramatically","pos":"adv.","def":"in a sudden and very noticeable way","cn":"大幅地;劇烈地","s":"The number of online students rose ________ during the pandemic, and many universities still offer online courses today.","zh":"疫情期間線上學生的人數大幅增加,許多大學至今仍提供線上課程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"大幅"},{"w":"rapid","pos":"adj.","def":"happening very quickly","cn":"快速的","s":"The ________ growth of AI surprised many experts, and governments are now hurrying to write new laws.","zh":"人工智慧的快速成長讓許多專家感到驚訝,各國政府現在正急著制定新法律。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"快速"},{"w":"gradual","pos":"adj.","def":"happening slowly over a long time","cn":"逐漸的","s":"There has been a ________ change in how people read news, because most now use their phones instead of newspapers.","zh":"人們閱讀新聞的方式出現了逐漸的改變,因為現在大多數人用手機而不是看報紙。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"逐漸的"},{"w":"shift","pos":"n.","def":"a change in position or direction","cn":"轉變;轉移","s":"There has been a big ________ from paper tests to online tests, but some students find reading on screens tiring.","zh":"考試已從紙本大幅轉變為線上測驗,但有些學生覺得在螢幕上閱讀很累。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"轉變"},{"w":"transition","pos":"n.","def":"the process of changing from one state to another","cn":"過渡;轉換","s":"The ________ to online banking was hard for my grandparents, so my cousin taught them how to use the app.","zh":"轉換到網路銀行的過渡期對我的祖父母來說很辛苦,所以我表哥教他們如何使用應用程式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"過渡期"},{"w":"evolve","pos":"v.","def":"to develop and change slowly over time","cn":"演變;逐步發展","s":"Chatbots have ________d from simple question-answer tools into assistants that can plan trips and write code.","zh":"聊天機器人已從簡單的問答工具演變成能規劃旅行和寫程式的助理。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"演變"},{"w":"sophisticated","pos":"adj.","def":"advanced and complicated","cn":"精密的;複雜的","s":"Modern scams are very ________, because criminals use AI to write perfect messages that look like real bank emails.","zh":"現代的詐騙非常精密,因為罪犯用人工智慧寫出看起來像真正銀行郵件的完美訊息。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"精密"},{"w":"complex","pos":"adj.","def":"made of many parts and difficult to understand","cn":"複雜的","s":"The AI's decision process is so ________ that even its designers cannot fully explain why it chose one answer.","zh":"人工智慧的決策過程非常複雜,連它的設計者都無法完全解釋它為什麼選擇某個答案。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"複雜"},{"w":"capability","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to do something","cn":"能力;性能","s":"The new phone has the ________ to translate conversations in real time, so travellers can chat easily with local people.","zh":"這支新手機具備即時翻譯對話的能力,所以旅客能輕鬆地和當地人聊天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"能力"},{"w":"constraint","pos":"n.","def":"something that limits what you can do","cn":"限制;約束","s":"Time is the biggest ________ for many teachers, so they welcome tools that help them prepare lessons more quickly.","zh":"時間是許多老師最大的限制,所以他們歡迎能幫助他們更快備課的工具。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"限制"},{"w":"limitation","pos":"n.","def":"a weakness or a point beyond which something cannot go","cn":"局限;限制","s":"One ________ of chatbots is that they sometimes make up facts, so users must always check important information.","zh":"聊天機器人的一個局限是它們有時會捏造事實,所以使用者必須隨時查核重要資訊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"局限"},{"w":"drawback","pos":"n.","def":"a disadvantage or problem","cn":"缺點","s":"The main ________ of online classes is that students have fewer chances to make friends, although they save travel time.","zh":"線上課程的主要缺點是學生交朋友的機會較少,雖然它們節省了通勤時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"缺點"},{"w":"benefit","pos":"v.","def":"to get help or an advantage from something","cn":"受益","s":"Students with reading difficulties can ________ from AI tools that read texts aloud, and they often feel more confident.","zh":"有閱讀困難的學生可以從朗讀文本的人工智慧工具中受益,而且他們通常會變得更有自信。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"受益"},{"w":"enable","pos":"v.","def":"to make it possible for someone to do something","cn":"使能夠","s":"Video calls ________ grandparents to see their grandchildren every day, even when they live in different countries.","zh":"視訊通話使祖父母能夠每天看到孫子孫女,即使他們住在不同的國家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"使 能夠"},{"w":"ensure","pos":"v.","def":"to make certain that something happens","cn":"確保","s":"Teachers must ________ that every student understands the AI rules, because some may cheat without knowing it.","zh":"老師必須確保每位學生都了解人工智慧的使用規定,因為有些人可能在不知情的情況下作弊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"確保"},{"w":"establish","pos":"v.","def":"to start or create something that will last","cn":"建立;設立","s":"The university ________ed an AI research centre last year, and it has already attracted students from many countries.","zh":"這所大學去年設立了一個人工智慧研究中心,而它已經吸引了來自許多國家的學生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"設立"},{"w":"framework","pos":"n.","def":"a set of ideas or rules used to make decisions","cn":"架構;框架","s":"The government created a ________ for safe AI use in schools, but each school can add its own rules.","zh":"政府為學校安全使用人工智慧建立了一套框架,但每所學校可以加入自己的規定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"框架"},{"w":"infrastructure","pos":"n.","def":"basic systems like roads, power and internet that a society needs","cn":"基礎建設","s":"Rural areas need better internet ________, because students there cannot join online classes when the connection is weak.","zh":"鄉村地區需要更好的網路基礎建設,因為那裡的學生在連線不穩時無法參加線上課程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"基礎建設"},{"w":"resource","pos":"n.","def":"something useful such as money, materials or information","cn":"資源","s":"The library offers many free online ________s, so students do not have to buy expensive books.","zh":"圖書館提供許多免費的線上資源,所以學生不必購買昂貴的書籍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"資源"},{"w":"fund","pos":"v.","def":"to provide money for something","cn":"資助;提供資金","s":"The company agreed to ________ a coding club at our school, so students can learn programming for free after class.","zh":"這家公司同意資助我們學校的程式社團,所以學生放學後可以免費學寫程式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"資助"},{"w":"budget","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of money available to spend","cn":"預算","s":"Our school has a small ________, so it cannot buy the newest computers, but it uses free AI tools instead.","zh":"我們學校的預算很少,所以買不起最新的電腦,但改用免費的人工智慧工具。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"預算"},{"w":"sector","pos":"n.","def":"one part of a country's economy or society","cn":"部門;產業","s":"The banking ________ was one of the first to use AI, because computers can spot strange payments very quickly.","zh":"銀行業是最早使用人工智慧的產業之一,因為電腦能非常快速地發現異常的付款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"業"},{"w":"domain","pos":"n.","def":"an area of knowledge or activity","cn":"領域","s":"AI is now used in almost every ________, from farming to music, but each area faces different problems.","zh":"人工智慧現在幾乎被用於每個領域,從農業到音樂,但每個領域面臨不同的問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"領域"},{"w":"context","pos":"n.","def":"the situation or information around something that helps explain it","cn":"上下文;背景脈絡","s":"A chatbot may translate a word wrongly if it misses the ________, so you should always read the whole sentence.","zh":"聊天機器人如果忽略了上下文,就可能把字翻錯,所以你應該永遠讀完整個句子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"上下文"},{"w":"aspect","pos":"n.","def":"one part or feature of something","cn":"方面;層面","s":"Speed is only one ________ of good writing, and AI cannot replace your own ideas, feelings and experiences.","zh":"速度只是好寫作的一個層面,而人工智慧無法取代你自己的想法、感受和經驗。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"層面"},{"w":"dimension","pos":"n.","def":"a part or feature of a situation","cn":"面向;層面","s":"AI adds a new ________ to the problem of cheating, because teachers can no longer easily tell who wrote an essay.","zh":"人工智慧為作弊問題增添了一個新的面向,因為老師再也無法輕易分辨作文是誰寫的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"面向"},{"w":"element","pos":"n.","def":"a basic part of something","cn":"要素;元素","s":"Trust is an important ________ of any online service, so companies must protect users' data carefully.","zh":"信任是任何線上服務的重要要素,所以公司必須小心保護使用者的資料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"要素"},{"w":"component","pos":"n.","def":"one of the parts that make up a machine or system","cn":"零件;組成部分","s":"Each ________ of the robot was made in a different country, and then they were put together in Taiwan.","zh":"這個機器人的每個零件都是在不同國家製造的,然後在台灣組裝起來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"零件"},{"w":"function","pos":"n.","def":"the job that something is designed to do","cn":"功能","s":"The most useful ________ of the app is the voice reader, because I can listen to articles while I walk to school.","zh":"這個應用程式最有用的功能是語音朗讀,因為我走路上學時可以聽文章。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"功能"},{"w":"mechanism","pos":"n.","def":"a system or process that does a particular job","cn":"機制","s":"The website has a ________ for reporting fake news, but few users know where to find the button.","zh":"這個網站有一套檢舉假新聞的機制,但很少使用者知道去哪裡找那個按鈕。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"機制"},{"w":"procedure","pos":"n.","def":"the official way of doing something","cn":"程序;步驟","s":"The school has a clear ________ for reporting online bullying, so students know exactly whom to talk to.","zh":"學校有一套清楚的網路霸凌通報程序,所以學生確切知道該找誰談。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"程序"},{"w":"method","pos":"n.","def":"a way of doing something","cn":"方法","s":"The flashcard ________ works well for memorising words, but you also need to read a lot to use them naturally.","zh":"字卡方法很適合背單字,但你也需要大量閱讀才能自然地運用它們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"方法"},{"w":"strategy","pos":"n.","def":"a plan for reaching a goal","cn":"策略","s":"A good study ________ is to test yourself often, because simply reading notes again does not help you remember much.","zh":"一個好的讀書策略是常常自我測驗,因為只是重讀筆記並不太能幫助你記憶。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"策略"},{"w":"technique","pos":"n.","def":"a special way of doing something that needs skill","cn":"技巧","s":"Our teacher showed us a ________ for checking facts online, and now I always compare three sources before I believe something.","zh":"老師教我們一個網路查證的技巧,現在我在相信某件事之前總會比對三個資料來源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"技巧"},{"w":"principle","pos":"n.","def":"a basic rule or belief","cn":"原則","s":"The company follows one simple ________: a human must check every decision before the AI's answer is sent to a customer.","zh":"這家公司遵守一個簡單的原則:在人工智慧的答案送給顧客之前,必須由人檢查每一個決定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"原則"},{"w":"concept","pos":"n.","def":"an idea or general understanding of something","cn":"概念","s":"The ________ of a robot teacher sounded strange ten years ago, but now some schools are already testing it.","zh":"機器人老師的概念十年前聽起來很奇怪,但現在有些學校已經在測試了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"概念"},{"w":"theory","pos":"n.","def":"an idea that tries to explain something","cn":"理論","s":"One ________ says that people trust machines more than humans, but recent studies show the opposite is often true.","zh":"有一種理論說人們比較相信機器而不是人類,但最近的研究顯示事實往往相反。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"理論"},{"w":"assumption","pos":"n.","def":"something you believe is true without proof","cn":"假設;假定","s":"Many people make the ________ that computers are never wrong, so they do not check the answers they receive.","zh":"許多人假定電腦永遠不會出錯,所以他們不檢查收到的答案。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"假定"},{"w":"assume","pos":"v.","def":"to think something is true without checking","cn":"假定;認為","s":"Don't ________ that a website is reliable just because it looks professional, because many fake sites look very real.","zh":"不要只因為網站看起來很專業就認定它可靠,因為許多假網站看起來非常逼真。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"認定"},{"w":"premise","pos":"n.","def":"an idea that an argument or plan is based on","cn":"前提","s":"The film's ________ is that robots have taken all human jobs, and the story follows one family trying to survive.","zh":"這部電影的前提是機器人已經取代了人類所有的工作,而故事描述一家人努力求生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"前提"},{"w":"perspective","pos":"n.","def":"a way of thinking about something","cn":"觀點;角度","s":"Talking to older workers gave me a new ________ on AI, because they remember how computers changed offices before.","zh":"和年長的員工聊天讓我對人工智慧有了新的觀點,因為他們記得電腦以前如何改變辦公室。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"觀點"},{"w":"stance","pos":"n.","def":"a public opinion on an issue","cn":"立場","s":"The school has taken a clear ________ on AI: students may use it for practice, but not for graded work.","zh":"學校對人工智慧採取了明確的立場:學生可以用它來練習,但不能用在要打分數的作業上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"立場"},{"w":"argue","pos":"v.","def":"to give reasons to support an opinion","cn":"主張;論證","s":"Some experts ________ that AI will create more jobs than it destroys, while others think many workers will be left behind.","zh":"有些專家主張人工智慧創造的工作會比它消滅的還多,而其他人則認為許多工人會被淘汰。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"主張"},{"w":"claim","pos":"v.","def":"to say something is true without proof","cn":"聲稱","s":"The company ________s that its app can teach you English in one month, but most users say real progress takes much longer.","zh":"這家公司聲稱它的應用程式能在一個月內教會你英文,但大多數使用者說真正的進步要花更久。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"聲稱"},{"w":"assert","pos":"v.","def":"to say something firmly and confidently","cn":"斷言;堅稱","s":"The inventor ________ed that his robot was completely safe, but reporters found several cases where it had hurt workers.","zh":"發明者堅稱他的機器人完全安全,但記者發現了幾起它傷害工人的案例。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"堅稱"},{"w":"contend","pos":"v.","def":"to say that something is true in an argument","cn":"主張;認為","s":"Critics ________ that AI art is not real art, because the machine does not feel anything when it makes a picture.","zh":"批評者主張人工智慧藝術不是真正的藝術,因為機器在創作時沒有任何感受。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"主張"},{"w":"acknowledge","pos":"v.","def":"to accept or admit that something is true","cn":"承認","s":"The company ________d that its chatbot gave wrong medical advice, and it promised to add more safety checks.","zh":"這家公司承認它的聊天機器人給了錯誤的醫療建議,並承諾增加更多安全檢查。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"承認"},{"w":"concede","pos":"v.","def":"to admit, often unwillingly, that something is true","cn":"(勉強)承認;讓步","s":"The teacher ________d that the AI's essay was well written, but she said it lacked any personal voice.","zh":"老師承認人工智慧寫的作文寫得很好,但她說它缺乏個人的聲音。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"承認"},{"w":"emphasise","pos":"v.","def":"to show that something is very important","cn":"強調","s":"Our principal ________d that AI is a tool, not a replacement for thinking, and every student should use it carefully.","zh":"我們校長強調人工智慧是一種工具,而不是思考的替代品,每位學生都應該謹慎使用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"強調"},{"w":"highlight","pos":"v.","def":"to draw attention to something important","cn":"突顯;強調","s":"The report ________s the danger of fake videos, and it asks social media companies to label AI content clearly.","zh":"這份報告突顯了假影片的危險,並要求社群媒體公司清楚標示人工智慧內容。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"突顯"},{"w":"illustrate","pos":"v.","def":"to explain something with examples or pictures","cn":"說明;闡明","s":"The teacher used a funny AI mistake to ________ why we should check facts, and the whole class laughed.","zh":"老師用一個好笑的人工智慧錯誤來說明為什麼我們應該查核事實,全班都笑了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"說明"},{"w":"demonstrate","pos":"v.","def":"to show clearly that something is true or how it works","cn":"證明;示範","s":"The engineer ________d how the robot could sort rubbish, and the audience was impressed by its speed.","zh":"工程師示範了機器人如何分類垃圾,觀眾對它的速度印象深刻。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"示範"},{"w":"indicate","pos":"v.","def":"to show or suggest that something is true","cn":"顯示;表明","s":"Recent surveys ________ that most teenagers use AI for homework, but only a few tell their teachers about it.","zh":"最近的調查顯示大多數青少年用人工智慧寫作業,但只有少數人會告訴老師。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"顯示"},{"w":"imply","pos":"v.","def":"to suggest something without saying it directly","cn":"暗示;意味著","s":"The teacher's smile ________d that she knew I had used AI, but she simply asked me to explain my answer.","zh":"老師的微笑暗示她知道我用了人工智慧,但她只是請我解釋我的答案。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"暗示"},{"w":"infer","pos":"v.","def":"to guess a fact from the information you have","cn":"推斷;推論","s":"From his perfect grammar, the teacher ________red that he had used an AI tool, so she asked him to rewrite it in class.","zh":"老師從他完美的文法推斷他用了人工智慧工具,所以要他在課堂上重寫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"推斷"},{"w":"conclude","pos":"v.","def":"to decide something after thinking about the facts","cn":"下結論;推斷","s":"After a year of testing, the researchers ________d that AI tutors help weaker students most, but strong students gain less.","zh":"經過一年的測試,研究人員得出結論:人工智慧家教對程度較弱的學生幫助最大,而程度好的學生獲益較少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"得出結論"},{"w":"interpret","pos":"v.","def":"to explain or understand the meaning of something","cn":"解讀;詮釋","s":"Machines can recognise words quickly, but they cannot always ________ jokes, so their translations sometimes sound strange.","zh":"機器能很快辨認文字,但它們不一定能解讀笑話,所以翻譯有時聽起來很奇怪。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"解讀"},{"w":"clarify","pos":"v.","def":"to make something easier to understand","cn":"澄清;闡明","s":"The school sent parents a letter to ________ the new phone rules, because many families had been confused.","zh":"學校寄信給家長以澄清新的手機規定,因為許多家庭感到困惑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"澄清"},{"w":"justify","pos":"v.","def":"to give good reasons for something","cn":"證明…合理;為…辯護","s":"The company could not ________ the high price of its AI course, so many customers asked for their money back.","zh":"這家公司無法合理解釋其人工智慧課程的高價,所以許多顧客要求退款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"合理解釋"},{"w":"validate","pos":"v.","def":"to prove that something is true or correct","cn":"驗證;證實","s":"Scientists must ________ the results of the AI study with real patients, because computer tests are not enough.","zh":"科學家必須用真實的病人來驗證這項人工智慧研究的結果,因為電腦測試是不夠的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"驗證"},{"w":"confirm","pos":"v.","def":"to show or say that something is definitely true","cn":"確認;證實","s":"The museum ________ed that the famous photo was made by AI, and it removed the picture from its website.","zh":"博物館證實那張知名照片是由人工智慧製作的,並將它從網站上撤下。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"證實"},{"w":"contradict","pos":"v.","def":"to say the opposite of what someone else has said","cn":"與…矛盾;反駁","s":"The chatbot's answer ________ed what our textbook said, so we asked the teacher which source was correct.","zh":"聊天機器人的答案和課本的說法矛盾,所以我們問老師哪個來源才正確。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"矛盾"},{"w":"challenge","pos":"v.","def":"to question whether something is true or right","cn":"質疑;挑戰","s":"Good students ________ information they read online, and they do not believe everything just because a computer says it.","zh":"好學生會質疑他們在網路上讀到的資訊,而不會只因為電腦這麼說就相信一切。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"質疑"},{"w":"dispute","pos":"v.","def":"to say that something is not true or correct","cn":"質疑;爭論","s":"The artist ________d the company's claim that its AI images were original, and she showed copies of her own paintings.","zh":"這位藝術家質疑公司聲稱其人工智慧圖片是原創的說法,並出示了她自己畫作的副本。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"質疑"},{"w":"criticise","pos":"v.","def":"to say what is wrong with someone or something","cn":"批評","s":"Parents ________d the game company because its app showed too many adverts to young children.","zh":"家長們批評這家遊戲公司,因為它的應用程式對幼童播放太多廣告。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"批評"},{"w":"criticism","pos":"n.","def":"comments saying what is wrong with something","cn":"批評","s":"The new exam system received a lot of ________, so the education department agreed to review it next year.","zh":"新的考試制度受到許多批評,所以教育部門同意明年重新檢討。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"批評"},{"w":"scrutiny","pos":"n.","def":"careful and detailed examination","cn":"仔細審查;監督","s":"AI companies are under close ________ from governments, because people want to know how their data is being used.","zh":"人工智慧公司正受到各國政府的嚴格審查,因為人們想知道自己的資料如何被使用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"審查"},{"w":"investigate","pos":"v.","def":"to try to find out the facts about something","cn":"調查","s":"The police are ________ing a fake video of the mayor, and they believe it was made with free AI software.","zh":"警方正在調查一段市長的假影片,他們認為它是用免費的人工智慧軟體製作的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"調查"},{"w":"survey","pos":"n.","def":"a set of questions asked to many people to learn their opinions","cn":"調查;問卷","s":"A recent ________ of university students found that most use AI weekly, but many feel unsure about the rules.","zh":"最近一項針對大學生的調查發現,大多數人每週使用人工智慧,但許多人對規定感到不確定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"調查"},{"w":"data","pos":"n.","def":"facts and numbers collected for study","cn":"數據;資料","s":"Companies collect huge amounts of ________ from our phones, and they use it to decide which adverts we see.","zh":"公司從我們的手機蒐集大量資料,並用它來決定我們會看到哪些廣告。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"資料"},{"w":"statistics","pos":"n.","def":"numbers that give information about something","cn":"統計數字","s":"Government ________ show that more older people are shopping online, so banks are offering classes to help them stay safe.","zh":"政府統計數據顯示越來越多長者在網路上購物,所以銀行正在開課幫助他們維護安全。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"統計數據"},{"w":"evidence","pos":"n.","def":"facts that show something is true","cn":"證據","s":"There is little ________ that AI apps alone improve exam results, but they seem to help when teachers guide their use.","zh":"幾乎沒有證據顯示單靠人工智慧應用程式就能提升考試成績,但在老師引導使用時似乎有幫助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"證據"},{"w":"empirical","pos":"adj.","def":"based on real experiments or observation, not theory","cn":"實證的;以經驗為依據的","s":"We need more ________ research on AI in classrooms, because most claims so far come from companies selling the tools.","zh":"我們需要更多關於課堂人工智慧的實證研究,因為目前大多數說法都來自販售這些工具的公司。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"實證"},{"w":"objective","pos":"adj.","def":"based on facts, not personal feelings","cn":"客觀的","s":"Some people think computers are more ________ than humans, but AI can also be unfair if it learns from biased data.","zh":"有些人認為電腦比人類更客觀,但人工智慧若從有偏見的資料中學習,也可能不公平。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"客觀"},{"w":"subjective","pos":"adj.","def":"based on personal feelings or opinions","cn":"主觀的","s":"Judging a poem is very ________, so many teachers do not trust AI to give fair scores for creative writing.","zh":"評斷一首詩是非常主觀的,所以許多老師不相信人工智慧能為創意寫作公平打分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"主觀的"},{"w":"reliable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be trusted","cn":"可靠的","s":"Wikipedia can be a useful starting point, but it is not always ________, so check the sources at the bottom of the page.","zh":"維基百科可以是有用的起點,但它不一定可靠,所以要查看頁面底部的資料來源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"可靠"},{"w":"valid","pos":"adj.","def":"based on good reasons or facts; acceptable","cn":"有效的;站得住腳的","s":"Your argument is ________, but you need more examples to support it, so try adding a real case from the news.","zh":"你的論點站得住腳,但你需要更多例子來支持它,所以試著加入一個新聞中的真實案例。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"站得住腳"},{"w":"accurate","pos":"adj.","def":"correct and true in every detail","cn":"準確的","s":"The weather app is usually ________, but yesterday it said sunny and we got caught in heavy rain on the way home.","zh":"天氣應用程式通常很準確,但昨天它說是晴天,結果我們回家路上被大雨淋到。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"準確"},{"w":"precise","pos":"adj.","def":"exact and clear in every detail","cn":"精確的","s":"The map gave ________ directions to the café, so we found it easily even though it was hidden in a small lane.","zh":"地圖給了到咖啡館的精確路線,所以即使它藏在一條小巷裡,我們還是很容易就找到了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"精確"},{"w":"consistent","pos":"adj.","def":"always behaving or happening in the same way","cn":"一致的;始終如一的","s":"If you practise English for ten minutes every day, your progress will be more ________ than if you study once a week for hours.","zh":"如果你每天練習英文十分鐘,你的進步會比一週讀一次好幾小時更穩定一致。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"穩定一致"},{"w":"inconsistent","pos":"adj.","def":"not staying the same; changing in a confusing way","cn":"不一致的;前後矛盾的","s":"The chatbot gave ________ answers to the same question, so I stopped trusting it for my science homework.","zh":"聊天機器人對同一個問題給出前後不一致的答案,所以我寫自然作業時不再相信它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"前後不一致的"},{"w":"random","pos":"adj.","def":"happening without any plan or pattern","cn":"隨機的","s":"The app shows ________ words each day, but I prefer lists that are organised by topic because they are easier to remember.","zh":"這個應用程式每天顯示隨機的單字,但我比較喜歡按主題分類的清單,因為比較好記。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"隨機的"},{"w":"sample","pos":"n.","def":"a small group chosen to represent a larger group","cn":"樣本","s":"The researchers asked a ________ of 500 students about AI, but critics said all of them came from city schools.","zh":"研究人員針對五百名學生的樣本詢問有關人工智慧的問題,但批評者說他們全都來自城市學校。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"樣本"},{"w":"participant","pos":"n.","def":"a person who takes part in an activity or study","cn":"參與者","s":"Each ________ in the study used an AI tutor for a month, and then they took the same English test again.","zh":"研究中的每位參與者都使用人工智慧家教一個月,然後再考一次相同的英文測驗。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"參與者"},{"w":"proportion","pos":"n.","def":"a part of a whole, compared with the total","cn":"比例","s":"A large ________ of online shoppers are now over sixty, so websites are making their text bigger and clearer.","zh":"網路購物者中有很大比例現在超過六十歲,所以網站正在把文字放大、變得更清楚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"比例"},{"w":"percentage","pos":"n.","def":"an amount shown as part of 100","cn":"百分比","s":"The ________ of homes with fast internet is high in Taipei, but it is much lower in the mountains.","zh":"在台北,擁有高速網路的家庭百分比很高,但在山區則低得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"百分比"},{"w":"majority","pos":"n.","def":"more than half of a group","cn":"大多數","s":"The ________ of my classmates use AI to check grammar, but only a few use it to write whole paragraphs.","zh":"我的同學中大多數都用人工智慧檢查文法,但只有少數人用它寫整段文章。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"大多數"},{"w":"minority","pos":"n.","def":"less than half of a group","cn":"少數","s":"Only a ________ of teachers have received AI training, so many are still unsure how to use it in lessons.","zh":"只有少數老師接受過人工智慧培訓,所以許多人仍不確定如何在課堂上使用它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"少數"},{"w":"approximately","pos":"adv.","def":"close to an exact number, but not exactly","cn":"大約","s":"________ half of all office tasks could be done by AI, but most jobs include skills that machines still cannot copy.","zh":"大約一半的辦公室工作可以由人工智慧完成,但大多數工作都包含機器仍無法複製的技能。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"大約"},{"w":"estimate","pos":"v.","def":"to guess a number or amount by thinking carefully","cn":"估計","s":"Experts ________ that the market for AI tools will double in five years, so many companies are hiring quickly.","zh":"專家估計人工智慧工具的市場將在五年內翻倍,所以許多公司正在快速招募人才。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"估計"},{"w":"predict","pos":"v.","def":"to say what will happen in the future","cn":"預測","s":"AI can ________ which students might fail a course, so teachers can offer extra help before it is too late.","zh":"人工智慧能預測哪些學生可能會被當,所以老師可以在為時已晚之前提供額外幫助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"預測"},{"w":"forecast / forecast / forecast","pos":"v.","def":"to say what will probably happen, often with weather or money","cn":"預測;預報","s":"The bank ________ that online payments would keep growing, so it closed several branches and opened a new app.","zh":"這家銀行預測線上付款會持續成長,所以關閉了幾家分行並推出新的應用程式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"預測"},{"w":"anticipate","pos":"v.","def":"to expect something and prepare for it","cn":"預期;預料","s":"We did not ________ that the new app would be so popular, so the servers crashed on the first day.","zh":"我們沒有預料到這個新應用程式會這麼受歡迎,所以伺服器在第一天就當機了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"預料到"},{"w":"speculate","pos":"v.","def":"to guess about something without enough facts","cn":"推測;揣測","s":"Many people ________ about what jobs will look like in 2050, but nobody can know for sure because technology changes so fast.","zh":"許多人推測2050年的工作會是什麼樣子,但沒有人能確定,因為科技變化太快了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"推測"},{"w":"likelihood","pos":"n.","def":"how probable something is","cn":"可能性","s":"The ________ of being tricked by a scam is higher for people who do not know about AI voice copies, so education is important.","zh":"不了解人工智慧聲音模仿的人被詐騙的可能性較高,所以教育很重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"可能性"},{"w":"probability","pos":"n.","def":"how likely something is to happen, often as a number","cn":"機率","s":"The app says there is a 70% ________ of rain, so I decided to bring an umbrella even though the sky looked clear.","zh":"應用程式說有百分之七十的降雨機率,所以雖然天空看起來很晴朗,我還是決定帶傘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"機率"},{"w":"uncertainty","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of not being sure about something","cn":"不確定性","s":"There is a lot of ________ about which jobs will survive, so many parents do not know what to tell their children to study.","zh":"哪些工作能留存下來有很大的不確定性,所以許多家長不知道該建議孩子讀什麼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"不確定性"},{"w":"ambiguous","pos":"adj.","def":"having more than one possible meaning","cn":"模稜兩可的;含糊的","s":"My prompt was ________, so the AI wrote a story about a bat the animal when I wanted one about a baseball bat.","zh":"我的提示詞模稜兩可,所以當我想要一個關於棒球棒的故事時,人工智慧寫了一個關於蝙蝠的故事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"模稜兩可"},{"w":"apparent","pos":"adj.","def":"easy to see or understand","cn":"明顯的","s":"It soon became ________ that the essay was written by AI, because it used words that the student had never learned.","zh":"很快就明顯看出那篇作文是人工智慧寫的,因為它用了那位學生從沒學過的字。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"明顯"},{"w":"evident","pos":"adj.","def":"clear and easy to notice","cn":"顯而易見的","s":"The benefits of online banking are ________, but older users still need help to protect themselves from scams.","zh":"網路銀行的好處顯而易見,但年長的使用者仍需要協助來保護自己免於詐騙。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"顯而易見"},{"w":"inherent","pos":"adj.","def":"being a natural part of something that cannot be removed","cn":"固有的;內在的","s":"There are ________ risks in sharing personal photos online, because once they are posted, you can never fully delete them.","zh":"在網路上分享個人照片有其固有的風險,因為一旦貼出,你就永遠無法完全刪除。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"固有的"},{"w":"fundamental","pos":"adj.","def":"basic and very important","cn":"基本的;根本的","s":"Reading and thinking are ________ skills, so students should not let AI do all their reading for them.","zh":"閱讀和思考是基本技能,所以學生不應該讓人工智慧替他們完成所有的閱讀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"基本"},{"w":"essential","pos":"adj.","def":"completely necessary","cn":"必要的;不可或缺的","s":"A stable internet connection is ________ for online classes, so the school lends Wi-Fi devices to families who need them.","zh":"穩定的網路連線對線上課程是不可或缺的,所以學校會借無線網路設備給有需要的家庭。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"不可或缺的"},{"w":"vital","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely important and necessary","cn":"極為重要的","s":"It is ________ to teach children about online safety early, because many of them have phones before they are ten.","zh":"及早教孩子網路安全是極為重要的,因為他們很多人不到十歲就有手機了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"極為重要的"},{"w":"primary","pos":"adj.","def":"main; most important","cn":"主要的","s":"The ________ goal of the new law is to protect children, but it also gives adults more control over their data.","zh":"這項新法律的主要目標是保護兒童,但它也讓成人對自己的資料有更多掌控。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"主要"},{"w":"secondary","pos":"adj.","def":"less important than something else","cn":"次要的","s":"For our teacher, the final grade is ________, and what matters most is that we learn to think for ourselves.","zh":"對我們的老師來說,最終成績是次要的,最重要的是我們學會獨立思考。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"次要的"},{"w":"subsequent","pos":"adj.","def":"happening after something else","cn":"隨後的;後續的","s":"The first version of the app had many problems, but ________ updates fixed most of them, so users came back.","zh":"這個應用程式的第一版有很多問題,但後續的更新修好了大部分,所以使用者又回來了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"後續的"},{"w":"prior","pos":"adj.","def":"happening before something","cn":"先前的;事先的","s":"No ________ experience is needed for the coding course, so anyone who is curious about AI can join.","zh":"這門程式課不需要事先的經驗,所以任何對人工智慧好奇的人都可以參加。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"事先的"},{"w":"previously","pos":"adv.","def":"before now or before a particular time","cn":"以前;先前","s":"The job was ________ done by three people, but now one worker and an AI program handle it together.","zh":"這份工作以前是由三個人做的,但現在由一名員工和一套人工智慧程式一起處理。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"以前"},{"w":"initially","pos":"adv.","def":"at the beginning","cn":"最初;起初","s":"________, I thought the AI tutor was boring, but after a few weeks I found that my speaking had improved a lot.","zh":"起初,我覺得人工智慧家教很無聊,但幾週後我發現我的口說進步了很多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"起初"},{"w":"ultimately","pos":"adv.","def":"in the end; finally","cn":"最終;終究","s":"AI can give advice, but ________ it is the doctor who must decide on the treatment and explain it to the patient.","zh":"人工智慧能給建議,但最終還是由醫生決定治療方式並向病人說明。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"最終"},{"w":"eventually","pos":"adv.","def":"after a long time or many problems","cn":"終於;最後","s":"The robot made many mistakes at first, but it ________ learned to fold clothes as well as a person.","zh":"這個機器人一開始犯了很多錯,但它最後學會了像人一樣好地摺衣服。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"最後"},{"w":"furthermore","pos":"adv.","def":"in addition; also","cn":"此外;而且","s":"The app is free, and ________, it works without the internet, so it is perfect for students in the countryside.","zh":"這個應用程式是免費的,而且它不需要網路就能使用,所以非常適合鄉下的學生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"而且"},{"w":"moreover","pos":"adv.","def":"used to add more information","cn":"此外;再者","s":"Online classes save travel time; ________, students can watch the recordings again if they miss something.","zh":"線上課程節省通勤時間;此外,學生如果漏掉什麼還可以再看錄影。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"此外"},{"w":"nevertheless","pos":"adv.","def":"despite what has just been said","cn":"儘管如此;然而","s":"The AI essay had perfect grammar; ________, the teacher gave it a low mark because it had no personal ideas.","zh":"那篇人工智慧作文文法完美;儘管如此,老師還是給了低分,因為它沒有個人的想法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"儘管如此"},{"w":"whereas","pos":"phr.","def":"used to compare two different facts","cn":"然而;反之","s":"My brother learns best from videos, ________ I prefer reading because I can stop and think about each sentence.","zh":"我哥哥看影片學得最好,而我比較喜歡閱讀,因為我可以停下來思考每個句子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"而"},{"w":"thereby","pos":"adv.","def":"as a result of this action","cn":"因此;從而","s":"The school blocked some websites during tests, ________ making it harder for students to search for answers online.","zh":"學校在考試期間封鎖了某些網站,從而讓學生更難上網搜尋答案。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"從而"},{"w":"hence","pos":"adv.","def":"for this reason","cn":"因此","s":"The robot cannot climb stairs, ________ it is only used on the ground floor, but the company is building a better model.","zh":"這個機器人不能爬樓梯,因此它只用在一樓,但公司正在打造更好的機型。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"因此"},{"w":"albeit","pos":"phr.","def":"although","cn":"雖然;儘管","s":"The new translation app is useful, ________ a little slow, so I still carry a small dictionary when I travel.","zh":"這個新的翻譯應用程式很有用,雖然有點慢,所以我旅行時還是會帶一本小字典。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"雖然"},{"w":"alternatively","pos":"adv.","def":"used to suggest another choice","cn":"或者;另一個選擇是","s":"You can hand in your project on paper; ________, you can upload it online, but please do not do both.","zh":"你可以交紙本專題;或者,你也可以上傳到網路,但請不要兩種都交。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"或者"},{"w":"alternative","pos":"n.","def":"another choice or possibility","cn":"替代方案;選擇","s":"If the school bans phones, it should offer an ________, such as tablets, so students can still use learning apps.","zh":"如果學校禁止手機,就應該提供替代方案,例如平板,讓學生仍能使用學習應用程式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"替代方案"},{"w":"equivalent","pos":"n.","def":"something that has the same value or meaning","cn":"相等物;同等的東西","s":"An hour of online tutoring costs the ________ of two cups of coffee, so many families can afford it.","zh":"一小時的線上家教費用相當於兩杯咖啡,所以許多家庭都負擔得起。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"相當於"},{"w":"comparable","pos":"adj.","def":"similar enough to be compared","cn":"可比較的;相當的","s":"The cheaper laptop has ________ speed to the expensive one, so I bought it and spent the extra money on books.","zh":"這台較便宜的筆電和貴的那台速度相當,所以我買了它,並把省下的錢拿去買書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"相當"},{"w":"relevant","pos":"adj.","def":"connected to what is being discussed","cn":"相關的","s":"The AI gave me lots of information, but much of it was not ________ to my topic, so I had to delete half of it.","zh":"人工智慧給了我很多資訊,但很多都和我的主題不相關,所以我必須刪掉一半。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"相關"},{"w":"appropriate","pos":"adj.","def":"suitable for a situation","cn":"適當的;合適的","s":"It is not ________ to use a chatbot during a test, but it can be a helpful study partner at home.","zh":"考試時使用聊天機器人是不適當的,但在家裡它可以是有幫助的讀書夥伴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"適當的"},{"w":"adequate","pos":"adj.","def":"enough or good enough for a purpose","cn":"足夠的;適當的","s":"Many rural schools do not have ________ computers, so students must share one device between three people.","zh":"許多鄉村學校沒有足夠的電腦,所以學生必須三個人共用一台設備。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"足夠的"},{"w":"sufficient","pos":"adj.","def":"enough for a particular purpose","cn":"充足的;足夠的","s":"One week was not ________ time to learn the new software, so the manager gave the team another training session.","zh":"一週的時間不足以學會新軟體,所以經理又為團隊安排了一次培訓課程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"足以"},{"w":"insufficient","pos":"adj.","def":"not enough","cn":"不足的","s":"The study used ________ data from older people, so its results may not apply to everyone.","zh":"這項研究使用的長者資料不足,所以它的結果可能不適用於每個人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"不足"},{"w":"abundant","pos":"adj.","def":"existing in large amounts","cn":"豐富的;大量的","s":"Information is ________ online, but good judgement is rare, so students must learn to choose the best sources.","zh":"網路上的資訊豐富,但良好的判斷力卻很少見,所以學生必須學會選擇最好的資料來源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"豐富"},{"w":"scarce","pos":"adj.","def":"not easy to find; not enough","cn":"稀少的;缺乏的","s":"Skilled AI engineers are ________ in many countries, so companies offer very high salaries to attract them.","zh":"許多國家都缺乏熟練的人工智慧工程師,所以公司提供非常高的薪水來吸引他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"缺乏"},{"w":"diverse","pos":"adj.","def":"including many different types of people or things","cn":"多樣的;多元的","s":"The company hired a ________ team to test its AI, because people from different backgrounds notice different problems.","zh":"這家公司聘請了一支多元的團隊來測試它的人工智慧,因為來自不同背景的人會注意到不同的問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"多元的"},{"w":"diversity","pos":"n.","def":"a range of many different people or things","cn":"多樣性","s":"There is little ________ in the photos used to train some AI systems, so they make more mistakes with certain faces.","zh":"用來訓練某些人工智慧系統的照片缺乏多樣性,所以它們在某些臉孔上犯更多錯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"多樣性"},{"w":"distinct","pos":"adj.","def":"clearly different or separate","cn":"不同的;明顯的","s":"Human writing and AI writing used to be quite ________, but now even teachers sometimes cannot tell them apart.","zh":"人類的寫作和人工智慧的寫作過去相當不同,但現在連老師有時都分辨不出來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"不同"},{"w":"distinguish","pos":"v.","def":"to see the difference between things","cn":"區分;辨別","s":"Young children often cannot ________ between real videos and AI videos, so parents should watch with them.","zh":"幼童常常無法區分真實影片和人工智慧影片,所以家長應該陪他們一起看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"區分"},{"w":"differentiate","pos":"v.","def":"to show or find the difference between things","cn":"區別;區分","s":"Good teachers ________ their lessons for different learners, and AI tools can help them prepare tasks at several levels.","zh":"好老師會針對不同的學習者區分教學內容,而人工智慧工具能幫助他們準備不同程度的任務。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"區分"},{"w":"categorise","pos":"v.","def":"to put things into groups","cn":"將…分類","s":"The email app ________s messages into work, shopping and social, so I can find important emails more quickly.","zh":"這個郵件應用程式把訊息分類成工作、購物和社交,所以我能更快找到重要的郵件。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"分類"},{"w":"identify","pos":"v.","def":"to recognise and name someone or something","cn":"辨識;找出","s":"The app can ________ a plant from a single photo, so our class used it during the school field trip.","zh":"這個應用程式能從一張照片辨識出植物,所以我們班在校外教學時用了它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"辨識"},{"w":"define","pos":"v.","def":"to explain the exact meaning of a word or idea","cn":"定義","s":"It is hard to ________ creativity, but most people agree that it involves new ideas, not just copying old ones.","zh":"定義創造力很難,但大多數人同意它涉及新的想法,而不只是模仿舊的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"定義"},{"w":"specify","pos":"v.","def":"to state something clearly and in detail","cn":"明確指出;具體說明","s":"The teacher asked us to ________ which parts of our project used AI, so she could fairly judge our own work.","zh":"老師要我們具體說明專題中哪些部分用了人工智慧,這樣她才能公平地評斷我們自己的作品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"具體說明"},{"w":"restrict","pos":"v.","def":"to limit what someone can do","cn":"限制","s":"Some parents ________ their children's screen use to one hour a day, but the children often find ways around the rules.","zh":"有些家長把孩子使用螢幕的時間限制在一天一小時,但孩子們常常找到規避規定的方法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"限制"},{"w":"restriction","pos":"n.","def":"a rule that limits what you can do","cn":"限制;規定","s":"The new ________s on AI in exams are strict, so students who break them may have to take the test again.","zh":"考試中使用人工智慧的新規定很嚴格,所以違反的學生可能必須重考。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"規定"},{"w":"prohibit","pos":"v.","def":"to officially forbid something","cn":"禁止","s":"The rules ________ students from recording teachers without permission, because it could break their privacy.","zh":"規定禁止學生未經允許錄下老師的影音,因為這可能侵犯他們的隱私。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"禁止"},{"w":"permit","pos":"v.","def":"to allow something officially","cn":"允許;准許","s":"Our school ________s AI for brainstorming, but it does not allow students to copy AI answers into their essays.","zh":"我們學校允許用人工智慧腦力激盪,但不准學生把人工智慧的答案抄進作文裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"允許"},{"w":"comply","pos":"v.","def":"to obey a rule or request","cn":"遵守;服從","s":"All apps sold in Europe must ________ with strict data laws, so some companies changed their products for those markets.","zh":"所有在歐洲販售的應用程式都必須遵守嚴格的資料法規,所以有些公司為那些市場修改了產品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"遵守"},{"w":"enforce","pos":"v.","def":"to make sure that people obey a rule or law","cn":"執行;強制實施","s":"It is difficult to ________ the no-AI rule at home, so teachers now give more writing tasks in class.","zh":"在家裡很難執行禁用人工智慧的規定,所以老師們現在在課堂上給更多寫作任務。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"執行"},{"w":"impose","pos":"v.","def":"to force people to accept a rule or cost","cn":"強制實施;施加","s":"The government plans to ________ heavy fines on companies that make deepfakes without clear labels.","zh":"政府計畫對製作深偽影片卻未清楚標示的公司處以高額罰款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"處以"},{"w":"authority","pos":"n.","def":"the power to make decisions, or an official group with this power","cn":"當局;權力","s":"The education ________ will decide next month whether students can use AI in the national exams.","zh":"教育當局將在下個月決定學生是否能在全國考試中使用人工智慧。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"當局"},{"w":"institution","pos":"n.","def":"a large important organisation, like a university or bank","cn":"機構","s":"Every ________ needs its own AI policy, because a hospital and a school face very different risks.","zh":"每個機構都需要自己的人工智慧政策,因為醫院和學校面臨的風險非常不同。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"機構"},{"w":"sustainable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to continue without harming the environment","cn":"永續的;可持續的","s":"AI uses a lot of energy, so companies are looking for more ________ ways to power their data centres.","zh":"人工智慧使用大量能源,所以公司正在尋找更永續的方式為它們的資料中心供電。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"永續的"},{"w":"participate","pos":"v.","def":"to take part in an activity","cn":"參與;參加","s":"Shy students often ________ more in online discussions, because they have time to think before they type.","zh":"害羞的學生在線上討論中通常參與得更多,因為他們在打字之前有時間思考。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"參與"},{"w":"collaborate","pos":"v.","def":"to work together with others","cn":"合作","s":"Students from Taiwan and Japan ________d on a project using online tools, and they presented it together on video.","zh":"台灣和日本的學生用線上工具合作完成一項專題,並一起用視訊發表。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"合作"},{"w":"cooperation","pos":"n.","def":"working together to reach a shared goal","cn":"合作;協力","s":"International ________ is needed to control AI, because the internet does not stop at any country's border.","zh":"管控人工智慧需要國際合作,因為網路不會在任何國家的邊界停下來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"合作"},{"w":"negotiate","pos":"v.","def":"to discuss something to reach an agreement","cn":"協商;談判","s":"The workers' union ________d with the company, so staff who lost jobs to AI will get training and extra pay.","zh":"工會與公司協商,所以因人工智慧而失業的員工將獲得培訓和額外補償。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"協商"},{"w":"resolve","pos":"v.","def":"to find a solution to a problem","cn":"解決","s":"The customer service bot could not ________ my problem, so I finally asked to speak to a real person.","zh":"客服機器人無法解決我的問題,所以我最後要求和真人通話。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"解決"},{"w":"address","pos":"v.","def":"to start dealing with a problem","cn":"處理;應對","s":"Schools must ________ the problem of AI cheating, but simply banning the tools is not likely to work.","zh":"學校必須處理人工智慧作弊的問題,但單純禁止這些工具不太可能有效。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"處理"},{"w":"confront","pos":"v.","def":"to face and deal with a difficult problem","cn":"面對;正視","s":"Society must ________ the fact that some jobs will disappear, so it should prepare workers for new kinds of work.","zh":"社會必須正視某些工作將會消失的事實,所以應該讓勞工為新型態的工作做好準備。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"正視"},{"w":"overcome / overcame / overcome","pos":"v.","def":"to succeed in dealing with a problem","cn":"克服","s":"My grandmother ________ her fear of computers, and now she video-calls her friends and shops online every week.","zh":"我奶奶克服了對電腦的恐懼,現在她每週都和朋友視訊並上網購物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"克服"},{"w":"obstacle","pos":"n.","def":"something that blocks you from doing something","cn":"障礙","s":"Cost is the biggest ________ for poor families, because they cannot afford laptops or fast internet for their children.","zh":"費用是貧困家庭最大的障礙,因為他們負擔不起孩子的筆電或高速網路。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"障礙"},{"w":"barrier","pos":"n.","def":"something that stops people from doing or getting something","cn":"障礙;隔閡","s":"Translation apps help break down language ________s, so tourists can talk to taxi drivers and shop owners easily.","zh":"翻譯應用程式幫助打破語言隔閡,所以遊客能輕鬆地和計程車司機及店主交談。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"隔閡"},{"w":"dilemma","pos":"n.","def":"a hard situation where you must choose between two options","cn":"兩難;困境","s":"Teachers face a ________: if they ban AI, students may fall behind, but if they allow it, students may stop thinking.","zh":"老師們面臨一個兩難:如果禁止人工智慧,學生可能會落後,但如果允許,學生可能會停止思考。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"兩難"},{"w":"paradox","pos":"n.","def":"a situation that seems strange because it has two opposite facts","cn":"矛盾;悖論","s":"It is a ________ that we have more ways to connect online than ever, but many young people say they feel lonelier.","zh":"這是一個矛盾:我們在網路上聯繫的方式比以往任何時候都多,但許多年輕人說他們感覺更孤單。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"矛盾"},{"w":"consensus","pos":"n.","def":"agreement among most people in a group","cn":"共識","s":"There is no ________ yet on how to use AI in schools, so each country is trying a different approach.","zh":"對於如何在學校使用人工智慧尚未有共識,所以每個國家都在嘗試不同的方法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"共識"},{"w":"conflict","pos":"n.","def":"a serious disagreement","cn":"衝突","s":"There is a ________ between parents who want more technology in class and parents who want children to read real books.","zh":"希望課堂上有更多科技的家長和希望孩子讀實體書的家長之間存在衝突。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"衝突"},{"w":"tension","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of worry or bad feeling between people","cn":"緊張關係","s":"There is growing ________ between artists and AI companies, because many artists feel their work was used without permission.","zh":"藝術家與人工智慧公司之間的緊張關係日益加劇,因為許多藝術家覺得他們的作品未經允許就被使用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"緊張關係"},{"w":"ramification","pos":"n.","def":"a possible result of an action, often unexpected","cn":"(意外的)後果;影響","s":"Few people thought about the ________s of sharing family photos online, but now these photos can be used to make deepfakes.","zh":"很少有人想過在網路上分享家庭照片的後果,但現在這些照片可能被用來製作深偽影片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"後果"},{"w":"impact","pos":"n.","def":"a strong effect on something","cn":"影響;衝擊","s":"AI will have a huge ________ on jobs, but its effect on our daily lives may be even bigger.","zh":"人工智慧將對工作造成巨大的衝擊,但它對我們日常生活的影響可能更大。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"衝擊"},{"w":"influence","pos":"v.","def":"to have an effect on how someone thinks or acts","cn":"影響","s":"Social media apps ________ what young people buy, because they show the same products again and again.","zh":"社群媒體應用程式影響年輕人購買的東西,因為它們一再展示相同的商品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"影響"},{"w":"affect","pos":"v.","def":"to cause a change in someone or something","cn":"影響","s":"Using phones late at night can ________ your sleep, so many students feel tired during morning classes.","zh":"深夜使用手機會影響你的睡眠,所以許多學生在早上的課堂上感到疲倦。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"影響"},{"w":"alter","pos":"v.","def":"to change something, usually slightly","cn":"改變;修改","s":"It is very easy to ________ a photo with AI, so you should not believe every picture you see online.","zh":"用人工智慧修改照片非常容易,所以你不應該相信網路上看到的每張圖片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"修改"},{"w":"modify","pos":"v.","def":"to change something a little to improve it","cn":"修改;調整","s":"The teacher ________d the test after she found that the AI could answer every question, and now it asks for personal opinions.","zh":"老師發現人工智慧能回答每個問題後修改了考卷,現在它要求寫出個人意見。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"修改"},{"w":"adapt","pos":"v.","def":"to change to suit a new situation","cn":"適應;調整","s":"Older workers can ________ to new technology, but they need patient training and enough time to practise.","zh":"年長員工能夠適應新科技,但他們需要有耐心的培訓和足夠的練習時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"適應"},{"w":"adjust","pos":"v.","def":"to change something slightly to make it work better","cn":"調整","s":"You can ________ the speed of the reading app, so beginners can listen slowly while advanced learners go faster.","zh":"你可以調整閱讀應用程式的速度,所以初學者可以慢慢聽,而進階學習者可以加快。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"調整"},{"w":"optimise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something work as well as possible","cn":"使最佳化;優化","s":"The delivery company uses AI to ________ its routes, so drivers save time and the company spends less on fuel.","zh":"這家物流公司用人工智慧優化路線,所以司機節省時間,公司也花更少的燃料費。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"優化"},{"w":"maximise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something as large as possible","cn":"使最大化","s":"Online shops use AI to ________ sales, but sometimes they push customers to buy things they do not need.","zh":"網路商店用人工智慧將銷售額最大化,但有時它們會促使顧客購買不需要的東西。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"最大化"},{"w":"minimise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something as small as possible","cn":"使減到最少","s":"To ________ the risk of scams, never share your password, and always call your bank if a message seems strange.","zh":"為了把詐騙風險降到最低,絕不要分享你的密碼,如果訊息看起來奇怪,一定要打電話給銀行。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"降到最低"},{"w":"eliminate","pos":"v.","def":"to remove something completely","cn":"消除;淘汰","s":"AI may ________ some boring office tasks, so workers can spend more time on creative and social work.","zh":"人工智慧可能會消除一些無聊的辦公室工作,讓員工能花更多時間在創意和社交工作上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"消除"},{"w":"diminish","pos":"v.","def":"to become or make smaller or less important","cn":"減少;減弱","s":"If students let AI think for them, their writing skills may ________, so teachers encourage them to write first drafts alone.","zh":"如果學生讓人工智慧替他們思考,他們的寫作能力可能會減弱,所以老師鼓勵他們獨自寫初稿。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"減弱"},{"w":"expand","pos":"v.","def":"to become or make bigger","cn":"擴大;擴展","s":"The online learning company plans to ________ into Southeast Asia, because many families there want cheap English lessons.","zh":"這家線上學習公司計畫擴展到東南亞,因為那裡許多家庭想要便宜的英文課。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"擴展"},{"w":"artificial intelligence","pos":"n.phr.","def":"computer systems that can think and learn like people","cn":"人工智慧","s":"______ ______ is changing the way we study, because students can now get instant explanations for difficult problems at any time.","zh":"人工智慧正在改變我們學習的方式,因為學生現在隨時都能針對困難的問題得到即時的解說。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"人工智慧"},{"w":"machine learning","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a way for computers to learn from data without step-by-step instructions","cn":"機器學習","s":"The music app uses ______ ______ to study the songs you skip, so its suggestions get better every week.","zh":"這個音樂應用程式使用機器學習來研究你跳過的歌曲,所以它的推薦每週都變得更好。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"機器學習"},{"w":"big data","pos":"n.phr.","def":"extremely large amounts of information studied by computers","cn":"大數據","s":"Supermarkets use ______ ______ to see what customers buy together, and then they place those products side by side.","zh":"超市使用大數據來了解顧客會一起購買哪些商品,然後把那些商品並排擺放。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"大數據"},{"w":"digital divide","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the gap between people who have technology and those who do not","cn":"數位落差","s":"The ______ ______ became clear during online classes, because some children had no computer while others had two.","zh":"線上課程期間數位落差變得很明顯,因為有些孩子沒有電腦,而其他人卻有兩台。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"數位落差"},{"w":"digital footprint","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the record of everything you do online","cn":"數位足跡","s":"Everything you post leaves a ______ ______, so think carefully before sharing photos that might embarrass you later.","zh":"你貼出的每樣東西都會留下數位足跡,所以在分享日後可能讓你難堪的照片前要仔細想想。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"數位足跡"},{"w":"at the cutting edge","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"using the newest and most advanced ideas","cn":"處於最尖端","s":"Taiwan's chip makers are ______ ______ ______ ______ of technology, so AI companies around the world depend on them.","zh":"台灣的晶片製造商處於科技的最尖端,所以全世界的人工智慧公司都依賴它們。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"處於 最尖端"},{"w":"job security","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the feeling that you will not lose your job","cn":"工作保障","s":"Many office workers worry about their ______ ______, because AI can already write emails and reports in seconds.","zh":"許多上班族擔心他們的工作保障,因為人工智慧已經能在幾秒內寫好電子郵件和報告。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"工作保障"},{"w":"academic integrity","pos":"n.phr.","def":"being honest in schoolwork and not cheating","cn":"學術誠信","s":"The university held a talk on ______ ______, because more students were handing in essays written by chatbots.","zh":"這所大學舉辦了一場關於學術誠信的講座,因為越來越多學生交出聊天機器人寫的作文。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"學術誠信"},{"w":"a double-edged sword","pos":"n.phr.","def":"something that has both good and bad effects","cn":"雙面刃","s":"AI is ______ ______ ______ for students, because it can explain hard ideas but also makes cheating very easy.","zh":"人工智慧對學生來說是一把雙面刃,因為它能解釋困難的概念,但也讓作弊變得非常容易。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"雙面刃"},{"w":"keep pace with","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to change or move as fast as something else","cn":"跟上","s":"Schools find it hard to ______ ______ ______ new technology, so their rules are often out of date by the time they are published.","zh":"學校發現很難跟上新科技,所以它們的規定在公布時往往已經過時了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"跟上"},{"w":"human error","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a mistake made by a person, not a machine","cn":"人為疏失","s":"Most car accidents are caused by ______ ______, so supporters of driverless cars believe they will make roads safer.","zh":"大多數車禍是由人為疏失造成的,所以無人駕駛車的支持者認為它們會讓道路更安全。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"人為疏失"},{"w":"take over","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to begin to do something that someone else did before","cn":"接手;取代","s":"Robots have ______ ______ many dangerous factory jobs, but humans are still needed to repair and check them.","zh":"機器人已經接手了許多危險的工廠工作,但仍需要人類來維修和檢查它們。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"接手"},{"w":"critical thinking","pos":"n.phr.","def":"careful thinking to judge whether information is true or good","cn":"批判性思考","s":"______ ______ is more important than ever, because AI can produce answers that sound confident but are completely wrong.","zh":"批判性思考比以往任何時候都更重要,因為人工智慧可能產生聽起來很有把握卻完全錯誤的答案。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"批判性思考"},{"w":"the human touch","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the kindness and understanding that only a person can give","cn":"人情味;人性化的關懷","s":"The robot nurse is efficient, but patients say it lacks ______ ______ ______, so they still prefer a real nurse's smile.","zh":"機器人護理師很有效率,但病人說它缺少人情味,所以他們仍偏好真人護理師的笑容。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"人情味"},{"w":"raise concerns","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make people worried about something","cn":"引發擔憂","s":"Facial scanning in schools has ______ ______ among parents, because nobody is sure how long the photos are kept.","zh":"學校的臉部掃描已在家長之間引發擔憂,因為沒有人確定這些照片會保存多久。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"引發擔憂"},{"w":"pros and cons","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the advantages and disadvantages of something","cn":"優缺點;利弊","s":"Our class debated the ______ ______ ______ of AI tutors, and most students agreed they are useful but cannot replace teachers.","zh":"我們班辯論了人工智慧家教的利弊,大多數學生同意它們很有用,但無法取代老師。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"利弊"},{"w":"in the long run","pos":"phr.","def":"over a long period of time in the future","cn":"長遠來看","s":"Learning to write well yourself takes effort, but ______ ______ ______ ______ it will help you much more than copying AI answers.","zh":"自己學會寫好文章需要努力,但長遠來看,它對你的幫助會比抄人工智慧的答案大得多。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"長遠來看"},{"w":"fall behind","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to fail to keep up with others","cn":"落後","s":"Workers who refuse to learn new digital skills may ______ ______, so many companies offer free training courses.","zh":"拒絕學習新數位技能的員工可能會落後,所以許多公司提供免費的培訓課程。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"落後"},{"w":"jump on the bandwagon","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to join something popular just because others are doing it","cn":"跟風;趕流行","s":"Many companies ______ ______ ______ ______ and added AI to their products, but some of these features are not useful at all.","zh":"許多公司跟風,在產品中加入人工智慧,但其中有些功能根本沒有用。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"跟風"},{"w":"game changer","pos":"n.phr.","def":"something that completely changes how things are done","cn":"改變局勢的事物;顛覆性創新","s":"Translation apps have been a ______ ______ for travellers, because they can now read signs and menus in any language.","zh":"翻譯應用程式對旅客來說是顛覆性的創新,因為他們現在能讀懂任何語言的標誌和菜單。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"顛覆性的創新"}]};
